#. key: animal skin
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:animal skin"
msgid ""
"A large piece of thick skin covered in fur, cut from the corpse of an animal\n"
"and worn as a primitive garment. It offers rudimentary protection against harm,\n"
"but, having never been tanned, it carries a light stench of rotting flesh.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et stort stykke tyk hud, dækket af pels, som er flået af et dyrekadaver, og som\n"
"kan bæres som en primitiv klædedragt. Den yder rudimentær beskyttelse mod slag,\n"
"men fordi det ikke er garvet, lugter det svagt af råddent kød.\n"

#. key: bardiche
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bardiche"
msgid ""
"A long pole with an enormous, cleaving blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lang stage med et enormt, kløvende blad i den ene ende.\n"

#. key: book of annihilations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of annihilations"
msgid ""
"A tome of arcane fury, greatly sought after by sorcerers. It allows the gifted\n"
"and resourceful to conjure destruction with ease.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne bogs lasede sider bløder, og selv analfabeter kan mærke kraften i det\n"
"mystiske raseri, den indeholder. Den er eftersøgt af troldmænd, for den lader\n"
"de dygtige og snarrådige styre den totale ødelæggelse så let som ingenting. Men\n"
"sølle troldkarle risikerer en krank skæbne, hvis de læser dette værk.\n"
"\n"
"ADVARSEL: Hvis det mislykkes at lære en besværgelse fra denne bog, vil den\n"
"angribe dig.\n"

#. key: book of cantrips
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of cantrips"
msgid ""
"A book containing a small selection of very basic magic spells, intended for\n"
"beginners who wish to learn the rudiments of one of the featured magical\n"
"schools.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog som indeholder et lille udvalg af de mest grundlæggende besværgelser,\n"
"beregnet på begyndere, som gerne vil lære en af de repræsenterede magiske\n"
"skolers mest rudimentære teknikker. Ikke desto mindre kan selv erfarne\n"
"troldmænd drage nytte af besværgelserne i den.\n"

#. key: book of conjurations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of conjurations"
msgid ""
"A book containing an introduction to the destructive magical arts of\n"
"Conjurations.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog, som indeholder en introduktion til fremmaningernes destruktive magiske\n"
"kunster. Når den åbnes, skælver den af kræfter, den knapt kan rumme. En meget\n"
"populær bog, som konstant bliver revideret og opdateret: Udgaven fra i år\n"
"fokuserer på elementerne is og luft.\n"

#. key: book of debilitation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of debilitation"
msgid ""
"A spellbook containing spells known for having a particularly unpleasant\n"
"effect on their victims. It's considered something of a faux pas in the\n"
"wizarding community to be seen with this book in one's collection.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog med forbandelser som er nyttige for en okkult skytte. Mange af siderne\n"
"er fyldt med huller, som om de blev brugt til at træne bueskydning med, før de\n"
"blev beskrevet og indbundet. Denne okkulte teknik skulle gøre besværgelserne\n"
"mere velegnede til brug med skydevåben, men i praksis fungerer de ikke\n"
"anderledes end de udgaver, der findes i mindre gennemhullede tekster.\n"

#. key: book of dreams
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of dreams"
msgid ""
"The somniloquent utterings of a famed mystic, using uniquely bizarre imagery\n"
"and cryptic digressions to describe spells drawn from the mystic's visions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Optegnelser over en mystikers mumlen, mens han var i trance, som beskriver en\n"
"række besværgelser, der afspejler mystikerens drømmetilstand. Værkets kritikere\n"
"mener, at besværgelserne ikke funktionelt adskiller sig fra allerede kendte\n"
"udgaver, men bogen er fortsat populær for sit bizarre billedsprog og sine\n"
"kryptiske sidebemærkninger.\n"

#. key: book of fixed level
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed level"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog med magiske besværgelser.\n"

#. key: book of fixed theme
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of fixed theme"
msgid ""
"A book of magic spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog med magiske besværgelser.\n"

#. key: book of necromancy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of necromancy"
msgid ""
"A macabre book containing basic Necromancy spells. Readers are recommended to\n"
"wear a pair of gloves they don't mind disposing of afterward.\n"
msgstr ""
"En makaber bog med magiske besværgelser, som ofte er den første grimoire, en\n"
"nybegynder udi nekromantikken studerer. På grund af de farer, der er forbundet\n"
"med at beskæftige sig med nekromantisk magi, er det også til tider den *sidste*\n"
"grimoire, en nybegynder udi nekromantikken studerer.\n"

#. key: book of power
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of power"
msgid ""
"A book of powerful and destructive magic spells, rumbling and shuddering with\n"
"barely-contained energies.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog med kraftfulde magiske besværgelser, som er eftersøgt af ambitiøse\n"
"troldmænd, der vil hæve sig over deres rivaler. Den knitrer og skælver af\n"
"energier, der med nød og næppe er dæmmet op for.\n"

#. key: book of spatial translocations
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of spatial translocations"
msgid ""
"A basic spellbook on the magical field of Translocations. Many would-be mages\n"
"have seen it disappear just as they needed it most.\n"
msgstr ""
"Klassiskeren over dem alle om translokationernes magiske felt, skrevet af\n"
"ærketroldmanden Golubria, som også var en dygtig forvrænger, for tohundrede år\n"
"siden. Bogen findes stadig i magiske biblioteker over hele verdenen, selvom den\n"
"ikke altid er der, hvor bibliotekaren efterlod den.\n"

#. key: book of the warp
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of the warp"
msgid ""
"A book of advanced Translocations spells, written by a particularly\n"
"misanthropic mage. After its completion, they were never seen again, which may\n"
"or may not have been the point.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bog med translokationsbesværgelser til erfarne forvrængere. Dens flimrende\n"
"sider eksisterer i flere dimensioner på samme tid, og det er ikke dem alle, der\n"
"overholder den konventionelle geometris regler. Nogle blade forsvinder, når de\n"
"vendes, andre dukker op ud af ingenting, og endnu andre passerer direkte gennem\n"
"andre sider eller sig selv. Nogle af bladene har tre sider, eller kun en, eller\n"
"antallet af hjørner er en brøk. Effekten kan være forstyrrende.\n"

#. key: book of unlife
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:book of unlife"
msgid ""
"An unholy book describing a variety of magical methods for the creation and\n"
"command of undead servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne uhellige bog beskriver en lang række magiske metoder til at skabe og\n"
"kontrollere udøde tjenere. Den skrækkelige bog udstråler en hadsk aura, og dens\n"
"pergamentsider spjætter og skælver ind i mellem af sig selv.\n"

#. key: box of beasts
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:box of beasts"
msgid ""
"A box filled with the bizarre leftovers of a depraved wizard's magical\n"
"experimentations. Opening it might set loose a friendly mutant beast: bizarre\n"
"creatures, each with their own combination of traits. Increased skill with\n"
"Evocations will allow stronger beasts to be released.\n"
"\n"
"There are six known traits:\n"
" * Bat beasts fly and move very quickly, but erratically.\n"
" * Fire beasts resist and breathe fire.\n"
" * Ox beasts resist cold, are armoured with thick fur, and can knock back foes.\n"
" * Shock beasts resist electricity and can transform into living lightning.\n"
" * Sting beasts resist poison and have a reaching poison-tail attack.\n"
" * Weird beasts can see invisible and attack with constricting tentacles.\n"
"\n"
"As far as anyone knows, all beasts have exactly two of these traits.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne æske indeholder en forkvaklet troldmands magiske eksperimenters bizarre\n"
"rester. Hvis den åbnes, kan den slippe en venlig kimære løs: en mytisk hybrid\n"
"som består af dele fra tre separate væsener.\n"

#. key: buckler
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:buckler"
msgid ""
"A small piece of wood and metal, to be strapped on one arm for defence.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et lille stykke træ og metal, som spændes på den ene arm til forsvar. Det er\n"
"lidt uhåndterligt, så en kriger uden en smule træning vil angribe en kende\n"
"langsommere.\n"

#. key: chain mail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chain mail"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour made entirely out of tiny metal rings.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som udelukkende består af små metalringe. Ringbrynje yder stærk\n"
"beskyttelse mod våben, kløer og savtænder, men forhindrer hurtig og snigende\n"
"bevægelse.\n"

#. key: cloak
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloth cloak.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stofkappe.\n"

#. key: corpse
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corpse"
msgid ""
"A corpse. Useless and dead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et kadaver. Du kan slagte det for at få spiselige kødklumper.\n"

#. key: crystal plate armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crystal plate armour"
msgid ""
"An incredibly heavy but extremely effective suit of crystalline armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"En utroligt tung, men ekstremt effektiv krystallinsk rustning.\n"

#. key: decaying skeleton
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:decaying skeleton"
msgid ""
"A decaying skeleton.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et rådnende skelet.\n"

#. key: deck of destruction
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of destruction"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards, most of which hurl death and destruction at one's foes\n"
"(or, if unlucky, at oneself).\n"
msgstr ""
"Et spil magiske kort som for det meste slynger død og ødelæggelse efter dine\n"
"fjender (eller dig selv hvis du er uheldig).\n"

#. key: deck of punishment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of punishment"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards which wreak havoc on the user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et spil magiske kort som hærger brugeren.\n"

#. key: deck of summoning
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deck of summoning"
msgid ""
"A deck of magical cards, depicting a range of weird and wonderful creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et spil magiske kort som afbilder en lang række sære og underfulde væsener.\n"

#. key: demon blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon blade"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, forged in the fires of Hell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et grufuldt våben, som er smedet i Helvedes ild. Det bliver endnu mere\n"
"dødbringende i hænderne på dem med en dæmonisk natur.\n"

#. key: demon trident
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon trident"
msgid ""
"A terrible three-pronged weapon, moulded by fire and brimstone.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et grufuldt, tregrenet våben, som er formet af ild og svovl.\n"

#. key: demon whip
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:demon whip"
msgid ""
"A terrible weapon, woven in the depths of the inferno.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et grufuldt våben, som er vævet i infernoets dybder.\n"

#. key: dire flail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dire flail"
msgid ""
"A flail with long spikes and a heavy head.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stridsplejl med lange pigge og et tungere hoved.\n"

#. key: eudemon blade
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eudemon blade"
msgid ""
"A sacred blade from the forges of Heaven, inhabited by a good spirit. It is a\n"
"favoured weapon of the Shining One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"En hellig klinge, som er frembragt af Himmelens smedjer og beboet af en god\n"
"ånd. Det er Den Strålendes tjeneres yndlingsvåben, og det kan ikke bruges af\n"
"ondskabens styrker.\n"

#. key: eveningstar
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eveningstar"
msgid ""
"The opposite of a morningstar. A balanced mace with a long shaft and a metal\n"
"head covered in lethal spikes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Piggene på denne morgenstjerne er exceptionelt lange, hvilket lader den\n"
"forårsage odiøse sår.\n"

#. key: fire dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fire dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a fire-breathing dragon. It provides great protection from fire,\n"
"while rendering its wearer more susceptible to cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"En magisk rustning, som er lavet af en ildsprudende drages skæl. Den beskytter\n"
"fremragende mod ild, men gør bæreren mere modtagelig over for effekterne af\n"
"kulde.\n"

#. key: giant spiked club
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant spiked club"
msgid ""
"A giant lump of wood with sharp spikes at one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kæmpe klump træ med spidse pigge i den ene ende.\n"

#. key: glaive
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive"
msgid ""
"A pole with a large, heavy blade on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stage med en stor, tung klinge i den ene ende.\n"

#. key: golden dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:golden dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a golden dragon. It is much heavier than most dragon scale\n"
"armours, and grants its wearer resistance to poison, fire and cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"En magisk rustning, som er lavet af en gulddrages skæl. Den er meget tungere\n"
"end de fleste drageskæls-rustninger og beskytter bæreren mod gift, ild og\n"
"kulde.\n"

#. key: gold piece
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gold piece"
msgid ""
"A pile of glittering gold coins.\n"
msgstr ""
"En bunke glimtende guldmønter.\n"

#. key: great mace
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great mace"
msgid ""
"An enormous metal war club, of great cumbrousness.\n"
msgstr ""
"En enorm stridskølle af metal, som er overordentligt uhåndterlig.\n"

#. key: hat
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat"
msgid ""
"A cloth hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"En hat af stof eller læder.\n"

#. key: helmet
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:helmet"
msgid ""
"A piece of metal headgear.\n"
msgstr ""
"En hovedbeklædning af metal.\n"

#. key: sling
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sling"
msgid ""
"A piece of cloth and leather for launching stones, adequate for hunting small\n"
"game like rabbits or goblins.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et stykke stof og læder, som bruges til at affyre sten med, som gør en lille\n"
"smule skade, når de rammer. I modsætning til andre affyringsvåben bliver den\n"
"ikke langsommere af, at man bruger et skjold samtidig.\n"

#. key: javelin
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:javelin"
msgid ""
"A lightweight spear, designed for throwing. It will pass through the targets it\n"
"hits, potentially hitting all targets in its path until it reaches maximum\n"
"range.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Kobold\" or you.race() == \"Spriggan\" then\n"
"        return \"Unfortunately, it is too long and awkward for you to use.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette lette spyd er designet til at blive kastet og kan forvolde alvorlige\n"
"skader.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Halfling\"\n"
"        or you.race() == \"Kobold\"\n"
"        or you.race() == \"Spriggan\"\n"
"    then\n"
"        return \"Det er desværre for langt og uhåndterligt til, at du kan \" ..\n"
"               \"bruge det.\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: kite shield
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:kite shield"
msgid ""
"A piece of wood and metal, to be strapped on one arm for defence.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et stykke træ og metal, som spændes på den ene arm til beskyttelse. Det er\n"
"uhåndterligt at gå med, og uden træning vil det få dig til at angribe\n"
"langsommere.\n"

#. key: lajatang
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lajatang"
msgid ""
"A very rare and extremely effective weapon, featuring a pole with half-moon\n"
"blades at both ends.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et meget sjældent og ekstremt effektivt eksotisk våben, bestående af en stav\n"
"med halvmåneformede klinger i begge ender.\n"

#. key: large rock
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:large rock"
msgid ""
"A very large and very heavy stone. {{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Ogre\"\n"
"       or you.race() == \"Troll\"\n"
"   then\n"
"       return \"\"\n"
"   else\n"
"       return \"Only large creatures are capable of throwing it.\"\n"
"   end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"En meget stor og meget tung sten. {{\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Ogre\"\n"
"       or you.race() == \"Troll\"\n"
"       or you.race() == \"Formicid\"\n"
"    then\n"
"        return \"\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        return \"Det kræver ekstraordinær styrke overhovedet at løfte en, \" ..\n"
"               \"og kun store væsener kan kaste den.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: leather armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:leather armour"
msgid ""
"A suit made from layers of tanned animal hide. It provides basic protection\n"
"with almost no hindrance to spellcasting or stealthy movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne lette rustning er lavet af lag af garvet dyrehud og yder grundlæggende\n"
"beskyttelse stort set uden at hæmme udførlige gestus eller hurtige, snigende\n"
"bevægelser.\n"

#. key: longbow
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow"
msgid ""
"A long, strong bow made of yew.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lang, stærk bue, lavet af takstræ. Den gør fremragende skade i kamp, og en\n"
"dygtig bueskytte kan bruge den overordentligt effektivt.\n"

#. key: orb of zot
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb of zot"
msgid ""
"An invaluable artefact. Once you have escaped to the surface with it, your\n"
"quest is complete.\n"
msgstr ""
"Når du er undsluppet til overfladen med dette uvurderlige klenodie, er din\n"
"søgen forbi.\n"

#. key: pair of boots
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of boots"
msgid ""
"A pair of boots. They are worn on the feet, and cover all but the largest\n"
"hooves and talons.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et par støvler.\n"

#. key: pair of gloves
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pair of gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves. They are worn on the hands, and cover all but the largest\n"
"claws.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et par handsker.\n"

#. key: pearl dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pearl dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The nacreous scales of a pearl dragon. It grants its wearer resistance to\n"
"negative energies.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som er lavet af de perlemorsfarvede skæl fra en perledrage. Den\n"
"giver bæreren modstandskraft over for negativ energi.\n"

#. key: phial of floods
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:phial of floods"
msgid ""
"An enchanted vessel of elemental water. Removing the stopper unleashes a torrent\n"
"of water, smashing the target and flooding the nearby area. If any creatures\n"
"engulfed by the wave need air to breathe, they'll be unable to cast spells until\n"
"they recover. The strength of the torrent and the duration of the flooding\n"
"increase with Evocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette fortryllede kar er ved at flyde over af elementarvand. Hvis man fjerner\n"
"proppen, flyder en rivende strøm af vand fra karret og slipper vandånderne i\n"
"den fri.\n"

#. key: potion of berserk rage
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of berserk rage"
msgid ""
"A potion which can send one into an incoherent rage, granting them a great but\n"
"temporary increase to their health, damage, and speed. In exchange, their mind\n"
"is clouded by anger, only allowing them to move and attack in melee. The rage\n"
"will wear off quickly if they do not attack monsters, and upon expiry, the\n"
"imbiber will be fatigued, causing them to slow dramatically and rendering them\n"
"unable to berserk again for a short duration.\n"
msgstr ""
"En trylledrik, som bevirker et usammenhængende raserianfald.\n"

#. key: potion of blood
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of blood"
msgid ""
"A potion containing the essence of life.\n"
msgstr ""
"En flaske, som indeholder livets essens. Den er livsvigtig for alle levende\n"
"væsener og for visse udøde. Den giver også næring til dem, der kan fordøje kød.\n"

#. key: potion of brilliance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of brilliance"
msgid ""
"A potion which increases the power of the drinker's spells and halves their\n"
"magic cost (rounding up).\n"
msgstr ""
"En trylledrik, som kan øge både intelligens og magisk kraft voldsomt hos den,\n"
"der drikker den.\n"

#. key: potion of enlightenment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of enlightenment"
msgid ""
"A potion which uplifts both the body and mind of its drinkers, lifting them\n"
"from the ground and increasing their Will to resist the world's temptations.\n"
msgstr ""
"En drik, som giver stor opdrift til den, der drikker den.\n"

#. key: potion of experience
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of experience"
msgid ""
"A truly wonderful and very rare drink, which grants experience when consumed.\n"
msgstr ""
"En virkeligt vidunderlig og særdeles sjælden drik.\n"

#. key: potion of invisibility
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of invisibility"
msgid ""
"A potion which confers invisibility on one who consumes it.\n"
msgstr ""
"En eliksir, som skjuler dig for andres øjne.\n"

#. key: potion of might
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of might"
msgid ""
"A potion which greatly increases the power of the drinker's melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"En trylledrik, som øger din styrke og fysiske kraft betragteligt, hvis du\n"
"drikker den.\n"

#. key: potion of mutation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of mutation"
msgid ""
"A potion which mutates the drinker, removing several mutations then\n"
"granting a few random mutations, which are likely (but not guaranteed) to be\n"
"beneficial.\n"
msgstr ""
"En drik, som gør overordentligt underlige ting ved dig.\n"

#. key: potion of resistance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion of resistance"
msgid ""
"A potion which grants temporary resistance to a variety of harmful effects:\n"
"fire, cold, electricity, poison, and acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"En trylledrik, som gør dig midlertidigt modstandsdygtig mod elementerne og\n"
"gift.\n"

#. key: quad damage
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quad damage"
msgid ""
"A mysterious item resembling a rune of some kind. Once evoked, it will make the\n"
"user glow blue and add a reverb to all sound... and there may be other effects\n"
"as well.\n"
msgstr ""
"En mystisk genstand, som ligner en form for rune. Når den aktiveres, får den\n"
"brugeren til at lyse blåt og får alle lyde til at give genlyd ... og måske er\n"
"der også andre virkninger.\n"

#. key: quarterstaff
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:quarterstaff"
msgid ""
"A sturdy wooden pole, meant for fighting.\n"
msgstr ""
"En solid træstang, som er lavet til kamp.\n"

#. key: ring of dexterity
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of dexterity"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the dexterity of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger eller formindsker din behændighed, når du har den på, afhængigt\n"
"af hvor meget, den er fortryllet.\n"

#. key: ring of evasion
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of evasion"
msgid ""
"A ring that makes its wearer more capable of avoiding attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring gør enten sin ejer bedre eller dårligere til at undgå angreb,\n"
"afhængigt af hvor meget, den er fortryllet.\n"

#. key: ring of intelligence
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of intelligence"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the intelligence of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger eller mindsker sin bærers mentale evner, afhængigt af hvor\n"
"meget den er fortryllet.\n"

#. key: ring of magical power
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of magical power"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases its wearer's reserves of magical power for so long as it\n"
"is worn.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger sin bærers reserver af magisk energi.\n"

#. key: ring of poison resistance
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of poison resistance"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from poison.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring beskytter sin bærer mod effekterne af gifte og edder.\n"

#. key: ring of protection
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from most sources of damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring beskytter dig mod skade eller gør dig mere sårbar, afhængigt af\n"
"fortryllelse, når du har den på.\n"

#. key: ring of protection from cold
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of protection from cold"
msgid ""
"A ring that protects its wearer from cold.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring beskytter mod kulde.\n"

#. key: ring of see invisible
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of see invisible"
msgid ""
"A ring that allows its wearer to see invisible things.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring lader bæreren se de ting, der er skjult af magi.\n"

#. key: ring of slaying
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of slaying"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the wearer's accuracy and damage with ranged weapons and\n"
"melee attacks.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger eller mindsker brugerens effektivitet med skydevåben og\n"
"nærkampsangreb. Den har to fortryllelser, som påvirker henholdsvis præcision og\n"
"skade.\n"

#. key: ring of strength
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of strength"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the strength of its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger eller mindsker sin bærers fysiske styrke, alt efter hvor\n"
"fortryllet den er.\n"

#. key: ring of wizardry
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of wizardry"
msgid ""
"A ring that increases the success rate of its wearer's magical spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne ring øger bærerens evne til at bruge magiske besværgelser.\n"

#. key: rune of zot
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rune of zot"
msgid ""
"A charm which allows entry into the Realm of Zot.\n"
msgstr ""
"En talisman, som lader dig træde ind i Zots domæne.\n"

#. key: sacred scourge
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sacred scourge"
msgid ""
"A blessed weapon, woven by the saints in Heaven and hated by the unholy. It is\n"
"a favoured weapon of the Shining One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"En velsignet våben, som er vævet af helgenerne i himmelen og hadet af det\n"
"uhellige. Den er et yndet våben for Den Strålendes tjenere.\n"

#. key: scale mail
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scale mail"
msgid ""
"A leather suit covered with metal plates attached to each other in overlapping\n"
"rows to provide full protection, but at the cost of reduced freedom of\n"
"movement.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne læderdragt er dækket af metalplader, som er sammenføjet i overlappende\n"
"rækker for at yde fuld beskyttelse, men på bekostning af reduceret\n"
"bevægelsesfrihed.\n"

#. key: scimitar
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scimitar"
msgid ""
"A long sword with a wide, curved blade.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et langt sværd med en bred, buet klinge.\n"

#. key: scroll of acquirement
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of acquirement"
msgid ""
"A wonderful scroll which causes the creation of a valuable item, with the\n"
"reader choosing from a small selection. The items offered will often be a\n"
"good match for the reader's skills; and if nothing recommends itself, the\n"
"reader can always choose a heap of gold.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne vidunderlige skriftrulle skaber en værdifuld genstand, hvis type er valgt\n"
"af læseren. De genstande, der skabes, er i høj grad vægtet mod overensstemmelse\n"
"med læserens færdigheder og mod udstyr, som læseren endnu ikke har set.\n"
"Desværre er der intet, der er sikkert.\n"

#. key: scroll of amnesia
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of amnesia"
msgid ""
"A scroll that allows its reader to selectively erase one spell from memory to\n"
"recapture the magical energy bound up with it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle lader læseren slette en valgfri besværgelse fra hukommelsen,\n"
"så den magiske energi, der er investeret i den, kan frigøres til andre formål.\n"

#. key: scroll of blinking
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of blinking"
msgid ""
"A scroll that allows its reader to teleport a short distance, with precise\n"
"control.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle lader læseren teleportere en kort distance med præcis\n"
"kontrol. Vær opmærksom på, at kontrolleret teleportation vil besmitte den\n"
"teleporterede med magisk energi.\n"

#. key: scroll of brand weapon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of brand weapon"
msgid ""
"A scroll that imbues a weapon with a random brand. Any existing brand will be\n"
"replaced with a different one, and any brand forbidden by your current god will\n"
"not be chosen. Artefacts cannot be branded in this way.\n"
"\n"
"Melee weapons will commonly be branded with the flaming, freezing, heavy,\n"
"venom or protection brand (or with the special brand exclusive to the category\n"
"of weapon being branded), and rarely with the draining, electrocution, spectral,\n"
"vampiric or chaos brand.\n"
"\n"
"Ranged weapons will commonly be branded with the flaming, freezing, heavy or\n"
"draining brand, and rarely with the electrocution or chaos brand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle fortryller et valgfrit våben, så det bliver langt mere\n"
"effektivt til at forvolde skade på dine fjender. Den kan gøre de midlertidige\n"
"præg, som visse besværgelser giver, permanente, eller den kan bruges på et\n"
"permanent præget våben for at vælge et nyt, tilfældigt præg.\n"
"\n"
"Præg som er tæt knyttet til en af guderne (Trog, Lugonu, Kikubaaqudgha, Den\n"
"Strålende) kan ikke fikseres på denne måde. Xom ville på den anden side ikke\n"
"lade så oplagt en mulighed for løjer gå til spilde.\n"

#. key: scroll of enchant armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of enchant armour"
msgid ""
"A scroll that places an enchantment on a piece of armour chosen by the reader.\n"
"Body armour and bardings can be enchanted up to the same value as their base\n"
"armour rating. Bucklers, kite shields and tower shields can be enchanted up to\n"
"+3, +5 or +8 respectively, and other armour can be enchanted up to +2. Magical\n"
"artefacts cannot be enchanted at all.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle fortryller et stykke rustning. De fleste former for rustning\n"
"kan kun fortrylles til +2, bortset fra skjolde, som kan fortrylles til +3, og\n"
"visse former for krops- og dyrerustning, som kan fortrylles til samme værdi som\n"
"deres basis-RK. Magiske artefakter kan slet ikke fortrylles.\n"
"\n"
"Den kan også bruges til at fortrylle visse eksotiske væseners skind.\n"

#. key: scroll of enchant weapon
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of enchant weapon"
msgid ""
"A scroll that places an enchantment on a weapon chosen by the reader,\n"
"increasing both accuracy and damage. Weapons can be enchanted up to +9. Magical\n"
"artefacts cannot be enchanted at all.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle fortryller et våben efter eget valg og gør det langt mere\n"
"effektivt i kamp ved at øge både præcision og skade. Det bliver sværere og\n"
"sværere at få den til at virke på stærkt fortryllede våben og kan aldrig\n"
"fortrylle dem højere end +9. Magiske artefakter kan slet ikke fortrylles.\n"

#. key: scroll of fear
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fear"
msgid ""
"A scroll that causes great fear in nearby foes, causing them to flee until\n"
"attacked, cornered, or enough time has passed.\n"
"\n"
"Non-living, undead and plant monsters cannot be feared, and berserk or frenzied\n"
"monsters are also immune.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle indgyder de, der ser den blive læst, med en afgrundsdyb\n"
"rædsel.\n"

#. key: scroll of fog
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of fog"
msgid ""
"A scroll that surrounds the reader with a dense cloud of fog, which can block\n"
"vision temporarily. The fog takes a short time to fully spill out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle indhyller læseren i en tæt sky af tåge.\n"

#. key: scroll of identify
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of identify"
msgid ""
"A useful magic scroll which identifies the properties of any unknown object.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne nyttige, magiske skriftrulle lader dig bestemme en given genstands\n"
"egenskaber, og vil lejlighedsvis tillade flere identifikationer.\n"
"\n"
"Hvis den bruges på en stak kort, vil den også afsløre det øverste kort.\n"

#. key: scroll of immolation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of immolation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that fills the creatures around the reader with an unstable and\n"
"powerful inner flame. This fire is released any time the victims are hit, and\n"
"explosively released upon their death. Giant creatures cause bigger explosions.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den skriftrulle fylder væsener omkring læseren med en ustabil og kraftfuld\n"
"indre flamme.\n"

#. key: scroll of noise
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of noise"
msgid ""
"A prank scroll that creates a loud noise when read.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne drilske skriftrulle som ofte sniges ned i en troldmands rygsæk af en\n"
"lusket lærling, laver et værre spektakel.\n"

#. key: scroll of revelation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of revelation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that reveals its reader's surroundings. The layout of the current\n"
"floor is fully mapped, and everything within a moderate radius, including\n"
"both visible and invisible monsters, is momentarily shown.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle afslører læserens omgivelser.\n"

#. key: scroll of silence
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of silence"
msgid ""
"A scroll that eliminates all sound near the reader. This makes reading scrolls,\n"
"casting spells, invoking divine abilities, or shouting impossible in the\n"
"reader's vicinity.\n"
"\n"
"Certain monsters have innate magical or special abilities which will still be\n"
"usable while silenced.\n"
"\n"
"The effect starts out with a large radius, which will then shrink, eventually\n"
"covering only the reader, before it times out.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle får alle lyde i nærheden af læseren til at forstumme. Det gør\n"
"det umuligt at læse skriftruller, kaste besværgelser eller råbe i nærheden af\n"
"læseren. Den trykkende, unaturlige stilhed vil gøre det aldeles svært at snige\n"
"sig.\n"
"\n"
"Stilheden starter med en radius afhængig af kraft indtil den kun dækker\n"
"læseren, hvorefter effekten ophører. Visse væsener, for eksempel dæmoner,\n"
"kaster besværgelser uden at tale og påvirkes derfor ikke. De, der har iboende\n"
"magiske effekter, vil også stadig kunne bruge dem.\n"

#. key: scroll of summoning
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of summoning"
msgid ""
"A scroll that calls forth several allied creatures woven from shadow into the\n"
"shapes of those beings found within the reader's immediate vicinity.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle hidkalder adskillige væsener, som er vævet af skygger til at\n"
"ligne de fjender, der findes i læserens umiddelbare nærhed.\n"

#. key: scroll of teleportation
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of teleportation"
msgid ""
"A scroll that translocates the reader to a random position after a short delay.\n"
"Reading this scroll while waiting for a teleportation will instead cancel it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kort tid efter at have læst ordene på denne skriftrulle, vil du blive\n"
"translokeret til en tilfældig position.\n"

#. key: scroll of torment
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of torment"
msgid ""
"A scroll that calls on the powers of darkness to inflict great pain on any\n"
"nearby creature — including the reader! This halves the resilience of all\n"
"living creatures and cuts down all holy creature resilence by about a third,\n"
"although it is never directly fatal.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle påkalder sig mørkets kræfter for at påføre væsener i nærheden\n"
"store smerter – inklusive dig! Dette halverer alle levende væseners livskraft,\n"
"men er aldrig decideret dødbringende.\n"

#. key: scroll of vulnerability
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll of vulnerability"
msgid ""
"A scroll that briefly halves the willpower of the reader and any nearby beings,\n"
"rendering them vulnerable to many magical effects. The scroll cannot affect\n"
"those fully immune to such effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne skriftrulle fjerner alle magiske fortryllelser fra læseren og fra væsener\n"
"i nærheden. Magisk modstandskraft hos læseren og andre væsener i nærheden vil\n"
"også blive halveret i en kort periode. Sidstnævnte effekt påvirker dog ikke\n"
"væsener som er komplet immune over for magi.\n"

#. key: scythe
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe"
msgid ""
"A farm implement, usually only used by untrained mobs in combat. In practice,\n"
"it's quite similar to a halberd.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et landbrugsredskab, der som regel bruges af utrænet bærme i kamp.\n"

#. key: short sword
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:short sword"
msgid ""
"A personal stabbing weapon with a short grip.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille, tveægget klinge med et kort greb.\n"

#. key: spear
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spear"
msgid ""
"A hunting weapon consisting of a wooden shaft with a pointed metal head\n"
"fastened on one end.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et jagtvåben, som består af et træskaft med et spidst metalhoved, som er\n"
"fæstnet i den ene ende.\n"

#. key: staff of air
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of air"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of air spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"insulates them from electricity. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations and\n"
"Air Magic, they can shock those struck by it, dealing electrical damage which\n"
"bypasses half of defenders' armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne stav øger brugerens luftbesværgelsers kraft, men mindsker den for\n"
"jordbesværgelser. Den isolerer brugeren mod elektricitet. Hvis brugeren er\n"
"dygtig til vækkelser og luftmagi, vil staven give dem, der rammes af den, stød.\n"

#. key: staff of cold
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of cold"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of ice spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from the effects of cold. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations\n"
"and Ice Magic, they can freeze those struck by it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne stav øger brugerens isbesværgelsers kraft, men nedsætter den for\n"
"ildbesværgelser. Den beskytter brugeren mod virkningerne af kulde. Hvis\n"
"brugeren er kyndig i vækkelser og ismagi kan staven fryse de fjender, den\n"
"rammer.\n"

#. key: staff of conjuration
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of conjuration"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of conjurations cast by its wielder. If the\n"
"wielder is skilled in Evocations and Conjurations, they can blast those they\n"
"strike with pure energy.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne stav øger brugerens fremmaningers kraft.\n"

#. key: staff of necromancy
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of necromancy"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of necromantic spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from negative energy. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations and\n"
"Necromancy, they can inflict great pain on those living souls they strike,\n"
"dealing negative energy damage which bypasses armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne stav øger brugerens nekromantiske besværgelsers kraft og beskytter mod\n"
"negativ energi. Hvis brugeren er kyndig i både vækkelser og nekromantik vil\n"
"staven forårsage store smerter, når den rammer levende sjæle.\n"

#. key: staff of earth
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of earth"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of earth spells cast by its wielder. If the\n"
"wielder is skilled in Evocations and Earth magic, they can fracture the ground\n"
"beneath those struck by it, dealing substantial damage - though much less to\n"
"creatures which fly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den stav øger brugerens jordbesværgelsers kraft, men mindsker den for\n"
"luftbesværgelser. Hvis brugeren er kyndig i vækkelser og jordmagi kan den knuse\n"
"dem, den rammer.\n"

#. key: staff of fire
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of fire"
msgid ""
"A staff that increases the power of fire spells cast by its wielder, and\n"
"protects them from the effects of fire. If the wielder is skilled in Evocations\n"
"and Fire Magic, they can burn those struck by it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne stav øger brugerens ildbesværgelsers kraft, men nedsætter den for\n"
"isbesværgelser. Den beskytter brugeren mod virkningerne af ild. Hvis brugeren\n"
"er kyndig i vækkelser og ildmagi kan staven fryse de fjender, den rammer.\n"

#. key: steam dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:steam dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a steam-breathing dragon. Unlike the scales of some larger\n"
"dragons, it does not provide its wearer with much protection (beyond a\n"
"resistance to scalding steam), but it is extremely light and supple.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som er lavet af skællene fra en drage, der ånder damp. Selvom den\n"
"i modsætning til rustninger, der er lavet af skællene fra visse større drager,\n"
"ikke yder den store beskyttelse, så er den ekstremt let og smidig.\n"

#. key: stone
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stone"
msgid ""
"A small chunk of dense but otherwise unremarkable natural mineral. It can be\n"
"thrown to cause minor damage.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille klump kompakt, men ellers ikke opsigtsvækkende naturligt forekommende\n"
"mineraler. Den kan kastes med hænderne eller affyres med en slynge.\n"

#. key: storm dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a lightning-breathing dragon. It is heavier than most dragon\n"
"scale armours, and gives its wearer resistance to electrical discharges.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som er lavet af skællene fra en drage med lynånde. Den er tungere\n"
"end de fleste rustninger af drageskæl og giver bæreren stor modstandskraft over\n"
"for elektriske udladninger.\n"

#. key: swamp dragon scales
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:swamp dragon scales"
msgid ""
"The scales of a swamp dragon. It confers resistance to poison on its wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som er lavet af skællene fra sumpdrage. Den giver bæreren\n"
"modstandskraft mod gift.\n"

#. key: throwing net
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:throwing net"
msgid ""
"A mesh of ropes knotted together with weights around the edge, used to entangle\n"
"and entrap targets. Struggling victims can eventually destroy the net and break\n"
"free, if they live long enough.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et net af reb, som er bundet sammen og har vægte i kanten, som bruges til at\n"
"besnære og indfange bytte. Sprællende ofre vil til sidst ødelægge nettet og\n"
"bryde fri hvis de lever længe nok.\n"

#. key: trident
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trident"
msgid ""
"A fishing spear improved with a longer shaft and a three-pronged metal head.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et fiskespyd, som er forbedret med et længere skaft og et tregrenet metalhoved.\n"

#. key: trishula
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trishula"
msgid ""
"A blessed trident moulded by cleansing flame, with three points symbolising the\n"
"combined might of the three holy gods. It is a favoured weapon of the Shining\n"
"One's servants.\n"
msgstr ""
"En velsignet trefork, som er formet af rensende flammer, med tre takker, som\n"
"symboliserer de tre hellige guders samlede kraft. Den er et yndet våben for Den\n"
"Strålendes tjenere.\n"

#. key: troll leather armour
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:troll leather armour"
msgid ""
"The stiff and knobbly skin of a troll. It magically regenerates its wearer's\n"
"flesh, once attuned to the wearer's body at full health.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rustning, som er lavet af det stive og noprede skind fra en helt almindelig\n"
"trold. Det regenerer lige så langsomt bærerens kød ved hjælp af magi (med\n"
"mindre vedkommende allerede er en trold).\n"

#. key: wand of digging
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of digging"
msgid ""
"A magical device which drills tunnels through unworked rock.\n"
msgstr ""
"En magisk anordning, som graver tunneller gennem uforarbejdet klippe.\n"

#. key: wand of polymorph
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand of polymorph"
msgid ""
"A magical device which causes a creature to be transmogrified into another\n"
"form. It is especially effective against shape-changing creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"En magisk anordning som omskaber et væsen til en anden form. Den er særligt\n"
"effektiv mod formskiftende væsener.\n"

#. key: whip
#: dat/descript/items.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:whip"
msgid ""
"A long plaited strip of leather. Originally developed for use in disagreements\n"
"with cattle, this simple weapon is now widely used to settle differences\n"
"between all sorts of creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et langt, flettet stykke læder. Dette enkle våben blev oprindeligt brugt i\n"
"uoverensstemmelser med kvæg, men bruges nu i uoverensstemmelser mellem alle\n"
"mulige former for væsener.\n"

#. key: amulet
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet"
msgid ""
"An amulet to be worn as jewellery around the neck, charged with arcane powers\n"
"of unknown provenance.\n"
msgstr ""
"En talisman, der kan bæres om halsen som et smykke og er ladet med mystiske\n"
"kræfter af ukendt herkomst.\n"

#. key: potion
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:potion"
msgid ""
"An unlabelled flask containing a single dose of unknown liquid.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille flaske væske.\n"

#. key: ring
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring"
msgid ""
"A ring charged with arcane forces of unknown provenance, to be worn as jewellery\n"
"on a finger.\n"
msgstr ""
"En talisman, ladet med mystiske kræfter af ukendt herkomst, som kan bæres som\n"
"smykke på en finger.\n"

#. key: scroll
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scroll"
msgid ""
"A disposable arcane formula inscribed on parchment by a professional scribe or\n"
"sorcerer. Anyone can evoke the power of the arcane formula by reading it out\n"
"loud, but the nature of that power is not a priori apparent.\n"
msgstr ""
"En rulle papir, som er dækket af magisk skrift.\n"

#. key: staff
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff"
msgid ""
"A staff improved with arcane powers of unknown nature.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stav, som er forbedret med mystiske kræfter af ukendt art.\n"

#. key: wand
#: dat/descript/unident.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wand"
msgid ""
"An unusually magical sort of stick.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kæp. Måske er den magisk.\n"

#. key: singing sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:singing sword"
msgid ""
"An enchanted blade which loves nothing more than to sing to its owner, whether\n"
"they want it to or not.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der er intet, dette fortryllede våben elsker mere end at synge for sin\n"
"ejermand, uanset om de vil have det eller ej.\n"

#. key: wrath of trog
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:wrath of trog"
msgid ""
"A bloodstained axe that was the favourite weapon of the old god Trog, before it\n"
"was lost. It induces a bloodthirsty berserker rage when used in battle, although\n"
"mere mortals who wield it will find themselves temporarily overwhelmed by Trog's\n"
"power.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette var den gamle gud Trogs yndlingsvåben, indtil det en dag gik tabt. Det\n"
"fylder enhver, som rammer en anden med det, med et blodtørstigt\n"
"bersærkerraseri.\n"

#. key: mace of variability
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mace of variability"
msgid ""
"A large mace said to have appeared when Xom grew bored with the predictability\n"
"of more ordinary instruments of chaos.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den er ganske upålidelig.\n"

#. key: staff of olgreb
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:staff of olgreb"
msgid ""
"A staff which was once wielded by the great alchemist Olgreb.\n"
msgstr ""
"Det var dette magiske våben, den mægtige troldmand Olgreb bar, da han afgik ved\n"
"døden et sted i disse underjordiske gange. Det øger sin brugers evne til at\n"
"bruge giftmagi og bærer på magiske kræfter, som kan vækkes. Ifølge\n"
"overleveringerne forskede Olgreb i sjældne gifte, som kunne have en begrænset\n"
"virkning selv på væsener, som ellers er immune over for alle kendte gifte.\n"
"Olgreb sørgede naturligvis for, at staven yder fuld beskyttelse mod selv hans\n"
"egne gifte.\n"

#. key: scythe of curses
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe of curses"
msgid ""
"A scythe surrounded by an ominous aura of dread. It carries a terrible and\n"
"ancient curse, which it busily inflicts on both the wielder and their enemies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette våben bærer en frygtelig og overordentligt irriterende forbandelse.\n"

#. key: sceptre of torment
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sceptre of torment"
msgid ""
"An accursed bone sceptre, created by some unknown hellish power. When used in\n"
"combat, it causes agonising pain in all those unfortunate enough to gaze upon\n"
"it, save for the wielder.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette overordentligt forbandede våben er et af Helvedes instrumenter.\n"

#. key: sword of cerebov
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sword of cerebov"
msgid ""
"A twisted blade, covered in eerie flames. Its demonic power burns away at the\n"
"very essence of those it is wielded against.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sælsomme flammer dækker dets forvredne klinge. Dets dæmoniske kraft brænder\n"
"noget af forsvarerens modstandskraft over for ild bort.\n"

#. key: faerie dragon scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:faerie dragon scales"
msgid ""
"An enchanted suit of armour created from the scales of a rare breed of dragon,\n"
"now thought to be extinct. This prized relic is now one of the last proofs that\n"
"the vividly coloured faerie dragons ever existed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fedrager var engang en race af samme art som de spættede. Uheldigvis blev deres\n"
"livlige farver deres undergang, fordi de advarede eventuelt bytte. De er nu\n"
"uddøde, og dette skattede relikvie er et af de sidste beviser på, at de\n"
"overhovedet har eksisteret.\n"

#. key: scimitar of flaming death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scimitar of flaming death"
msgid ""
"A scimitar with a mysteriously smoking blade. Occasionally its heat leaks out,\n"
"covering opponents in magical flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Brandvarm!\n"

#. key: dagger of chilly death
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dagger of chilly death"
msgid ""
"A dagger made of one huge shard of sapphire. It covers opponents in ice,\n"
"slowing down their movement somewhat.\n"
msgstr ""
"En dolk, som er lavet af et kæmpe stykke safir.\n"

#. key: scythe "finisher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scythe \"finisher\""
msgid ""
"A long and exceedingly sharp scythe, capable of eviscerating in a single blow.\n"
"Its extraordinary speed is the work of a mad wizard, who spent years refining\n"
"it before discarding it in a fit of rage.\n"
"\n"
"The blade looses a low keen as it cuts through the air.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lang og skarp le, som er særligt modificeret til brug i kamp.\n"

#. key: giant club "skullcrusher"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:giant club \"skullcrusher\""
msgid ""
"A massive enchanted cudgel that augments the already considerable strength of\n"
"anyone mighty enough to wield it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne yndige knippel kan fylde enhver jætte med fryd – uanset om det gælder\n"
"barslagsmål, folkedrab eller en blanding af de to.\n"

#. key: glaive of the guard
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:glaive of the guard"
msgid ""
"A glaive commissioned several years ago by a wealthy queen fearful for the\n"
"safety of her vast treasury. No foe, the smith promised, could defeat a guard\n"
"wielding such a weapon!\n"
"\n"
"It was stolen a few months later, along with the rest of the queen's treasury;\n"
"the guard, it transpired, had been caught napping. Still, it should serve more\n"
"than adequately in the hands of a waking user.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette våben har engang tilhørt Gar Dogh, som vogtede en konges skatte. I følge\n"
"legenderne for han vild et sted i de underjordiske gange.\n"

#. key: zealot's sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:zealot's sword"
msgid ""
"A sword made of one huge piece of crystal. Legend says it was the Shining One's\n"
"gift to a worshipper. This blade is notorious for inducing bloodthirsty rage in\n"
"both the wielder and all of their followers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et langsværd, som er lavet af et kæmpe stykke krystal. Legenderne vil vide, at\n"
"det var en gave fra Den Strålende til en tilbeder. Klingen er berygtet for at\n"
"fremkalde et blodtørstigt raseri i både brugeren og alle hans eller hendes\n"
"dødelige følgesvende.\n"

#. key: sword of the dread knight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sword of the dread knight"
msgid ""
"An adamantine great sword. Its first wielder was a worshipper of Yredelemnul\n"
"who eschewed the use of magic in combat, preferring to destroy her enemies with\n"
"brute force. Unfortunately for her, not all of her opponents shared her\n"
"limitations.\n"
"\n"
"It has felled countless great warriors under her grip, and the souls of those\n"
"who had their lives taken beckon it to take even more under its new owner.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et ubrydeligt slagsværd.\n"

#. key: morningstar "eos"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:morningstar \"eos\""
msgid ""
"A jewelled morningstar, glowing brightly with the light of the dawn. It\n"
"illuminates the dungeon's recesses, revealing the machinations of those who\n"
"would prefer to stay invisible.\n"
msgstr ""
"Daggryets rosenrøde fingre ...\n"

#. key: spear of the botono
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spear of the botono"
msgid ""
"A dark and malign artefact. It increases the potency of hexes cast by anyone\n"
"unwise enough to risk wielding it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et mørkt og ildesindet artefakt. Hos de, der er ubesindige nok til at bære den,\n"
"øger den effekten af de forbandelser, de kaster.\n"

#. key: mithril axe "arga"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mithril axe \"arga\""
msgid ""
"A beautiful mithril axe, probably lost by some dwarven hero.\n"
msgstr ""
"En smuk økse af mitril, som en eller anden dværghelt nok har tabt.\n"

#. key: longbow "piercer"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:longbow \"piercer\""
msgid ""
"An exceptionally large metal longbow.\n"
msgstr ""
"En exceptionelt stor langbue af metal.\n"

#. key: blowgun of the assassin
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blowgun of the assassin"
msgid ""
"This blowgun seems to guide the needle to seek the most lethal point to hit\n"
"the target, packing a nasty punch.\n"
msgstr ""
"Det er udformet til at være let at skjule, men det sparker stadig som en hest.\n"

#. key: lance "wyrmbane"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lance \"wyrmbane\""
msgid ""
"An enchanted lance deadly to all dragonkind. It grows more powerful every time\n"
"it inflicts a killing blow on a strong dragon. The more powerful it grows, the\n"
"harder it will be to find a worthy opponent.\n"
msgstr ""
"En fortryllet lanse, som vokser sig mere og mere mægtig for hver gang, den\n"
"nedlægger en stærk drage. Jo mere mægtig den bliver, jo sværere bliver det at\n"
"finde en værdig modstander.\n"

#. key: plutonium sword
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:plutonium sword"
msgid ""
"A triple sword made of weird glowing metal. It irradiates those it strikes,\n"
"causing a range of unpredictable effects — if they survive the impact of the\n"
"blade itself, that is.\n"
msgstr ""
"En triple sword af et underligt, glødende metal. Du spekulerer over, om strålingen\n"
"vil få et ekstra hoved til at vokse frem på dine skuldre.\n"

#. key: great mace "undeadhunter"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:great mace \"undeadhunter\""
msgid ""
"A weapon imbued with magic to disrupt and destroy the forces binding undead\n"
"creatures together. Legends say that, long ago, a lich lord created many\n"
"such weapons to ensure the loyalty of his undead servants. Sadly, this mace\n"
"might be the last one left.\n"
msgstr ""
"Legenderne vil vide, at for længe siden eksperimenterede en dødningeherre med\n"
"at skabe bevidste tjenere i stedet for tankeløse tingester. For at sikre sig\n"
"deres loyalitet lavede han en række våben, som var præget med magi, der kunne\n"
"modvirke den, der holdt udøde sammen, og dermed forvolde dem stor skade.\n"
"\n"
"Selvom dødningen for længst er gået til grunde, så siges hans våben at have\n"
"været meget populære på grund af den ravage, de forvolder blandt udøde. Denne\n"
"stridskølle er muligvis det eneste af våbnene, der findes endnu.\n"

#. key: knife of accuracy
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:knife of accuracy"
msgid ""
"It is almost unerringly accurate.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den er næsten usvigeligt præcis.\n"

#. key: lehudib's crystal spear
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lehudib's crystal spear"
msgid ""
"Presumably this relic led to the invention of the famous spell, or maybe the\n"
"other way around.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette relikvie førte formentlig til opfindelsen af den berømte besværgelse,\n"
"eller også var det omvendt.\n"

#. key: captain's cutlass
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:captain's cutlass"
msgid ""
"An infamous weapon, once used by a vile pirate captain to slaughter countless\n"
"innocents. He finally met his destiny when a kraken swallowed his ship, and the\n"
"cutlass was thought to be lost with him.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette berygtede våben blev brugt af en vederstyggelig sørøver til at slagte\n"
"utallige uskyldige. Han mødte omsider sit endeligt, da en kraken slugte hans\n"
"skib med hele mandskabet om bord. Huggerten regnedes for at være tabt for\n"
"evigt, men nu holder du beviset på dit modsatte i din hule hånd.\n"

#. key: storm bow
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:storm bow"
msgid ""
"A longbow with the colour of dark rain clouds that fires arrows like lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne bue har samme farve som mørke regnvejrsskyer og lugter af våd ozon.\n"

#. key: tower shield of ignorance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield of ignorance"
msgid ""
"A shield unearthed from the remains of a ruined city. It bears an inscription\n"
"written in an ancient language. Scholars and wise men laboured for countless\n"
"hours to decipher it, and in time, a translation was finally settled on:\n"
"\n"
"\"With a shield like this, who needs to think?\"\n"
msgstr ""
"»Et åbent sind er som en fæstning, hvor portene står åbne og murene er\n"
"ubevogtede.«\n"

#. key: robe of augmentation
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of augmentation"
msgid ""
"A variegated robe, woven with enchantments to enhance the wearer's physical and\n"
"mental abilities. Its creators wove in strands of hair from a hundred different\n"
"animals, each chosen for the unique strengths it could grant the robe's wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kåbe af den fineste silke.\n"

#. key: cloak of the thief
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of the thief"
msgid ""
"A pitch-black cloak which allows its wearer to excel in the arts of thievery.\n"
"Even the clumsy will find their footsteps softer and the shouts of their\n"
"adversaries less attention-getting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den lader bæreren brillere i tyveriets kunst og kan udløse tykke røgskyer, når\n"
"den vækkes, så det bliver lettere at tage flugten.\n"

#. key: tower shield "bullseye"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:tower shield \"bullseye\""
msgid ""
"Just in case you had trouble getting hit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bare hvis du nu havde svært ved at blive ramt.\n"

#. key: crown of dyrovepreva
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crown of dyrovepreva"
msgid ""
"A large circlet of dull bronze, set with a dazzling array of gemstones. It was\n"
"first worn by a prince of the Titans, who sought protection from the incessant\n"
"warfare between his fellow princes. In practice, the main effect of the\n"
"artefact was to unite his rivals against him.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stor krone af mat bronze, som er indlagt med et funklende udvalg af\n"
"ædelsten.\n"

#. key: hat of the bear spirit
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the bear spirit"
msgid ""
"A fur hat once owned by Ukta, a powerful ogre shaman. It houses the spirit of\n"
"an especially mighty bear, whose rages devastated the ogres until it was slain.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne pelshat tilhørte engang Ukta, en mægtig jætte-shaman, og huser en særligt\n"
"mægtig bjørns ånd.\n"

#. key: robe of misfortune
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of misfortune"
msgid ""
"A splendid flowing robe of fur and silk whose lucky colour has faded.\n"
msgstr ""
"En pragtfuld, flagrende kåbe af pels og silke.\n"

#. key: cloak of flash
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of flash"
msgid ""
"A cloak that twitches and jerks without any intervention.\n"
msgstr ""
"En vibrerende kappe.\n"

#. key: lear's hauberk
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lear's hauberk"
msgid ""
"A well-made golden hauberk that covers all of its wearer's body parts. It\n"
"includes a chainmail coif, chausses and maille gauntlets.\n"
msgstr ""
"En veludført, gylden kjortel af ringbrynje, som dækker alle brugerens lemmer.\n"
"Den inkluderer en hjelmhue, hoser og brynjehandsker.\n"

#. key: skin of zhor
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:skin of zhor"
msgid ""
"The {{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"smelly \"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}skin of some strange animal, native to cold and distant lands. It radiates\n"
"the chill of its native habitat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et sært dyrs stinkende skind.\n"

#. key: salamander hide armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:salamander hide armour"
msgid ""
"Most salamanders' bodies are consigned to the fiery depths from which they\n"
"sprang. Rarely, though, salamanders instead preserve the skins of those that\n"
"passed. The runes and decorations on this hide suggest it once belonged to a\n"
"respected warrior or priest - perhaps even a king. The fiery spirit remains in\n"
"the skin, granting its power to the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"En læderrustning, som er lavet af en salamanders skind.\n"

#. key: gauntlets of war
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gauntlets of war"
msgid ""
"A pair of thick steel gauntlets. They were Okawaru's reward for a mighty\n"
"warlord. The owner is destined to die in battle, but what a death it will be!\n"
msgstr ""
"Disse tykke stålhandsker var Okawarus belønning til en mægtig krigsherre.\n"
"Fortjener du at eje dem?\n"

#. key: shield of resistance
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shield of resistance"
msgid ""
"A bronze shield, looking almost exactly like a tortoise's shell. It was built\n"
"by the adherents of an obscure minor faith, who imbued it with the power of\n"
"their god. As the god is said to, this shield protects against sword and sling,\n"
"frost and flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et bronzeskjold.\n"

#. key: robe of folly
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of folly"
msgid ""
"A dull grey robe. It is enchanted to provide mages with immeasurable power,\n"
"and more than a little overconfidence...\n"
msgstr ""
"En kedelig, grå kåbe. Den er fortryllet, så den giver sin bærer umådelig kraft\n"
"og visdom.\n"

#. key: maxwell's patent armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maxwell's patent armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created by the famous inventor Maxwell, providing unparalleled\n"
"protective qualities at a very affordable price. His unorthodox materials left\n"
"it with certain shortcomings, but he's yet to have anyone come back for a\n"
"refund.\n"
msgstr ""
"En underligt udseende rustning.\n"

#. key: mask of the dragon
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mask of the dragon"
msgid ""
"The mask of the High Priest of ancient Erebora. In ancient times, the gods of\n"
"the Ereborans ceased to answer their prayers, and in desperation, the people\n"
"turned to the forbidden worship of dragons. Now, of their works, only this mask\n"
"remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"En sær, blå hjelm, som er lavet af hårdt, men fleksibelt læder, der får\n"
"bærerens ansigt til at ligne en drages åsyn.\n"

#. key: scales of the dragon king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:scales of the dragon king"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour created from the enchanted scales of a once-mighty king of\n"
"dragons. In his time, titans and lesser dragons struggled with him in vain —\n"
"but as with all things, even he was eventually cast down and undone. Of his\n"
"life and deeds, this is all that remains.\n"
msgstr ""
"Engang for længe siden tog en mægtig gulddrage magten over alle dragerne i hans\n"
"del af verden. Men hans regeringstid blev kort, bragt til ende af et enkelt,\n"
"ynkeligt menneske, som efterfølgende lavede denne rustning af dragens skind.\n"

#. key: hat of the alchemist
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the alchemist"
msgid ""
"A dirty hat. It bears signs of surviving many weird explosions, which suggests\n"
"it may have means of protecting the head inside from the risks involved with\n"
"alchemy experiments.\n"
msgstr ""
"En beskidt hat. Den bærer præg af at have overlevet mange mystiske\n"
"eksplosioner, hvilket kunne tyde på, at den er i stand til at beskytte det\n"
"hoved, der er indeni, mod de risici, der er forbundet med alkymistiske\n"
"eksperimenter. Og med den beskyttelse, hatten yder, har det med garanti krævet\n"
"en forudgående hjerneskade overhovedet at overveje sådanne eksperimenter.\n"

#. key: fencer's gloves
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:fencer's gloves"
msgid ""
"A pair of gloves made of white silk.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et par handsker, som er lavet af hvid silke.\n"

#. key: cloak of starlight
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cloak of starlight"
msgid ""
"A phosphorescent cloak, woven of pure light beams. The ripples of its folds\n"
"as the wearer leaps and swerves in combat may dazzle those who gaze on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"En fosforescerende kappe, som er vævet af rene lysstråler.\n"

#. key: ratskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ratskin cloak"
msgid ""
"A cloak stitched from the hides of hundreds of hell rats by an enchantress with\n"
"far too much time on her hands. Many more rats remain somehow concealed within\n"
"it, and may scurry out to assist the wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"En fortryllerske med en magisk væv og for meget fritid syede denne kappe af\n"
"skindet fra hundredvis af rotter, hovedsagligt de orange af slagsen. Den er\n"
"lidt akavet at have på og ser tåbelig ud, men den yder fremragende beskyttelse\n"
"mod alle slags rotter.\n"

#. key: amulet of the air
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of the air"
msgid ""
"A sky-blue amulet, suffused with enchantments that protect the wearer and make\n"
"their Air spells more powerful. Its creator lacked just one thing: a steady\n"
"hand.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mange af denne himmelblå amulets beskyttende egenskaber må stamme fra en\n"
"magtfuld lufttroldmand. Det eneste, han manglede, var åbenbart en rolig hånd.\n"

#. key: amulet of cekugob
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of cekugob"
msgid ""
"A strange-looking piece of crystal on an ordinary-looking string, with an odd\n"
"selection of powers.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et underligt udseende stykke krystal i en almindeligt udseende snor med et\n"
"besynderligt udvalg af kræfter.\n"

#. key: amulet of tranquility
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:amulet of tranquility"
msgid ""
"A pendant made of purest jade. It grants its wearer immense willpower and\n"
"mental fortitude.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette vedhæng er lavet af den reneste jade og giver sin bærer umådelig okkult\n"
"styrke, når det kommer til at ryste fjendtlig magi af sig.\n"

#. key: necklace of bloodlust
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:necklace of bloodlust"
msgid ""
"A necklace made of bloodstained human and animal teeth, and something that\n"
"appears to be a piece of spine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du undrer dig over hvilket brutalt bæst, der ville gå med en blodindsmurt\n"
"halskæde af menneske- og dyretænder og noget, der ser ud til at være en flækket\n"
"ryghvirvel.\n"

#. key: ring of the mage
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the mage"
msgid ""
"An enchanted sapphire, inset into a ring. It aids the spellcasting of its\n"
"wearer.\n"
msgstr ""
"En fortryllet safir, som er indfattet i en ring. Den hjælper bæreren med at\n"
"kaste besværgelser.\n"

#. key: brooch of shielding
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brooch of shielding"
msgid ""
"A brooch with an intricate inlaid design, providing a range of magical\n"
"protections. Back in the good old days, every adventurer had one of these handy\n"
"devices. That, and a pony.\n"
msgstr ""
"I de gode, gamle dage havde alle eventyrere en af de her praktiske anordninger.\n"
"Sådan en og en pony.\n"

#. key: robe of clouds
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:robe of clouds"
msgid ""
"A robe of a material as nebulous and insubstantial as the clouds. It whips the\n"
"air around it up into a furious storm as it ripples and swirls.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kåbe af et så skrøbeligt materiale, at det næsten kunne være skyer.\n"

#. key: obsidian axe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:obsidian axe"
msgid ""
"An axe with a powerful curse placed on it by one of the lords of Pandemonium,\n"
"so that unsuspecting adventurers would unleash demons into this world. Beware,\n"
"for it has ways of taking its wielder under its command...\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne økse er forbandet af en af Pandæmoniums herrer, så intetanende eventyrere\n"
"som dig kommer til at slippe dæmoner løs i denne verden. Tag dig i agt, for\n"
"denne økse kan tage magten over den, der bærer den ...\n"

#. key: lightning scales
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lightning scales"
msgid ""
"A set of armoured plates assembled to protect a creature with a long, scaly\n"
"lower body. Faintly crackling with electricity, they supercharge their wearer's\n"
"ability to cover distance.\n"
msgstr ""
"Disse skæl er blevet formet som en rustning til den nedre del af en nagas krop.\n"
"De knitrer svagt af elektricitet og er fortryllet til at lade bæreren bugte sig\n"
"af sted næsten lige så hurtigt som et menneske.\n"

#. key: autumn katana
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:autumn katana"
msgid ""
"An exquisitely crafted sword. Its blade is so sharp that it can cut through\n"
"space itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette eksotiske sværd er et våben for oplyste krigere.\n"

#. key: shillelagh "devastator"
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shillelagh \"devastator\""
msgid ""
"A wooden cudgel, loaded with more than just lead.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du gætter på, at denne pind er ladet med mere end bare bly.\n"

#. key: dragonskin cloak
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dragonskin cloak"
msgid ""
"An opalescent cloak gleaming with the colours of all kinds of dragons. It\n"
"imbues the wearer with draconic resistances, although somewhat unreliably.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne opaliserende kappe glimter med alle dragers farver. Den beskytter bæreren\n"
"mod alle former for elementarangreb, men er desværre ikke synderligt pålidelig.\n"

#. key: ring of the octopus king
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ring of the octopus king"
msgid ""
"One of the eight rings once worn by the Octopus King and now scattered across\n"
"the land. Each has its own unique enchantment.\n"
msgstr ""
"»En havfrue med sangen så kær\n"
" Vakte blækspruttekongens begær\n"
" Hendes blævrende bejler\n"
" Blev gejler og gejler Men med så mange ringe var opgaven svær.«\n"

#. key: axe of woe
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:axe of woe"
msgid ""
"As you hold this axe your mind does not feel fully your own. Your body begins\n"
"to exhibit strength far beyond its capabilities, and your movements become\n"
"guided by Makhleb.\n"
msgstr ""
"Da du griber om skaftet på denne økse, føles dit sind ikke længere helt som dit\n"
"eget. Din krop begynder at udvise en hidtil umulig styrke, og dine bevægelser\n"
"bliver styret af Makhleb.\n"

#. key: moon troll leather armour
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:moon troll leather armour"
msgid ""
"A suit of armour rumoured to have been created by enchanting the hide of a\n"
"now-extinct species of troll. Whether the name rings true or is merely\n"
"appropriated to add mystique is something of a mystery. The armour's innate\n"
"powers of regeneration and magical protection, however, are hard to dispute.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne rustning blev efter sigende skabt ved at fortrylle skindet fra en nu\n"
"uddød race af trolde. Det er umuligt at sige med sikkerhed, om denne rustning\n"
"virkelig er en rest fra de legendariske vindrædsler, eller blot en tillempning\n"
"for at gøre den mere mystisk. Men dens magt til hurtigt at helbrede brugeren på\n"
"bekostning af magisk kraft er i hvert fald ikke til at komme uden om.\n"

#. key: macabre finger necklace
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:macabre finger necklace"
msgid ""
"An ugly dangling finger on a string. Everything about it reeks of malign\n"
"influences... but it's hard to avoid thinking that it would look better with a\n"
"ring on it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Denne dinglende finger ville tage sig bedre ud med en ring på.\n"

#. key: boots of the spider
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boots of the spider"
msgid ""
"A novel pair of boots invented by a suitor of Arachne.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et opfindsomt par støvler, som en af Arachnes bejlere hittede på.\n"

#. key: hat of the high council
#: dat/descript/unrand.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hat of the high council"
msgid ""
"A relic of some ancient wizarding war. Centuries later, it still crackles with\n"
"effects from the residual hexes and magical energies it was once subjected to\n"
"on a daily basis; spellcasters able to get a handle on its power, however, will\n"
"find it enhances the power of their spells.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et relikvie fra en fordums trolddomskrig. Flere århundreder senere knitrer det\n"
"stadig af virkningerne af de resterende forbandelser og magiske energier, som\n"
"det engang blev udsat for på daglig basis. Trolddomsbrugere, som formår at\n"
"tøjle dets kræfter, vil dog opdage, at den øger deres besværgelsers kraft.\n"

#. key: __(_suffix_examine
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:__(_suffix_examine"
msgid ""
"It has been enchanted to dance through the air and attack under its own power.\n"
msgstr ""
"En fortryllelse får våbnet til at danse gennem luften og angribe af sig selv.\n"

#. key: aizul
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:aizul"
msgid ""
"Once the primary guardian serpent of a legendary treasure hoard, she was\n"
"disgraced after thieves looted it while she slept. She seeks to make up for her\n"
"failure by protecting the only treasure the villains overlooked, a single\n"
"precious talisman.\n"
msgstr ""
"En gang var denne slange den fremmeste vogter af en legendarisk skat, men han\n"
"faldt i unåde da skatten blev stjålet, mens han sov. Han snor sig nu rundt i de\n"
"underjordiske gange og søger at hævne sig på alle vordende røvere. Han er en\n"
"talentfuld troldkarl, men ikke mere farlig i nærkamp end andre af sin slags.\n"

#. key: asmodeus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:asmodeus"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most cunning of the Lords of Hell, Asmodeus was born when the twin\n"
"fires of greed and treachery first sparked to life within a mortal's heart.\n"
"His hideous body is perpetually wreathed in flame.\n"
msgstr ""
"En af de ærkedæmoner, som har hjemme i Helvedes dyb, omsluttet af ild.\n"

#. key: azrael
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azrael"
msgid ""
"A powerful, belligerent efreet. (Is there any other kind?)\n"
msgstr ""
"En magtfuld, krigerisk ifrit. (Findes der nogen anden slags?)\n"

#. key: boris
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:boris"
msgid ""
"An ancient and powerful lich. Like all true liches, Boris is immortal, and will\n"
"regenerate his desiccated skeletal remains even if completely disintegrated.\n"
"The same cannot be said for his many victims over his many centuries, from\n"
"which he collects and channels their dying woes and regrets.\n"
msgstr ""
"En ældgammel og mægtig dødning. Som alle sande dødninge er Boris udødelig og\n"
"vil regenerere sine udtørrede knogler, selv hvis de fuldstændigt nedbrydes.\n"

#. key: cerebov
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cerebov"
msgid ""
"A violent and wrathful demon, Cerebov appears as a giant humanoid covered in\n"
"shining golden armour and wielding a huge twisted sword.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cerebov, en voldelig og arrig dæmon, fremstår som et gigantisk menneske klædt i\n"
"en skinnende, gylden rustning og bevæbnet med et enormt, bølget sværd.\n"

#. key: chuck
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:chuck"
msgid ""
"Chuck the stone giant loves rocks, the bigger the better! Over the years, he\n"
"has managed to amass quite the collection, including some rare, enchanted ones.\n"
msgstr ""
"Stenkæmpen Chuck elsker sten, jo større, jo bedre! Gennem årene har han\n"
"akkumuleret en pæn samling, inklusive nogle sjældne, fortryllede nogle af\n"
"slagsen.\n"

#. key: crazy yiuf
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:crazy yiuf"
msgid ""
"A withered old gnoll with a long silver beard, wielding a quarterstaff and\n"
"wearing a cloak. He looks like a figure from mythology! Wait, is his beard held\n"
"on to his ears with hooks?\n"
msgstr ""
"En runken, gammel gnold med et langt, sølvfarvet skæg. Han er bevæbnet med en\n"
"stav og bærer en kappe. Han ligner en mytologisk figur! Vent, er hans skæg\n"
"fæstnet til hans ører med kroge?\n"

#. key: dispater
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dispater"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most ruthless of the Lords of Hell, Dispater was born when first an\n"
"iron sword drank mortal blood. They despise mortal vanities, the pursuit of\n"
"‘reason’ and ‘beauty’ - the only art they enjoy is the art of war.\n"
msgstr ""
"Herren over Jernbyen Dis.\n"

#. key: dissolution
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dissolution"
msgid ""
"The Pits of Slime used to be a thriving civilisation, and Dissolution was the\n"
"prophet of their god. When the city was overtaken by its current residents,\n"
"only Dissolution survived, for they alone turned faithfully to the Slime God.\n"
"Dissolution became a tremendous mass of acidic ooze, yet retained their\n"
"intelligence. They are filled with hatred for anything that can hold a form.\n"
msgstr ""
"Slimbrøndene var engang en blomstrende civilisation, og Nedbryderen var profet\n"
"for dennes gud. Da byen blev erobret af dens nuværende indbyggere, overlevede\n"
"kun Nedbryderen da han som den eneste rettroende søgte hjælp hos slimguden.\n"
"Nedbryderen blev en kolossal masse af slimsyre, men beholdt sit intellekt. Han\n"
"er fyldt med had mod alt der kan opretholde en fast form.\n"

#. key: donald
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:donald"
msgid ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"An adventurer just like you, trying to find the Orb.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" Unlike you, and d\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" D\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"espite his hatred of it, he takes to water \" ..\n"
"                           \"like a fowl.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local descript = \"En eventyrer som dig, der prøver at finde sfæren.\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() ~= \"Merfolk\" and you.race() ~= \"Octopode\" then\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" I modsætning til dig, og p\"\n"
"    else\n"
"        descript = descript .. \" p\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    descript = descript .. \"å trods af hans had til det, så klarer han sig \" ..\n"
"                           \"som fjerkræ i vandet.\"\n"
"\n"
"    return descript\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: dowan
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dowan"
msgid ""
"A beautiful but vain deep elf with an aptitude for magic and little else. His\n"
"skills are the perfect complement of his twin sister Duvessa's fighting prowess.\n"
"In search of more powerful spells, he journeys to the surface with his sister.\n"
msgstr ""
"En smuk, men forfængelig elver med talent for magi og ikke meget andet. Hans\n"
"evner supplerer hans tvillingesøster Duvessas kampdygtighed perfekt.\n"

#. key: duvessa
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:duvessa"
msgid ""
"A plain-looking deep elven fighter who is technically brilliant in many forms of\n"
"combat, but over-confident because of it. She is complemented by the magical\n"
"skills of her twin brother, Dowan. She journeys to the surface to challenge\n"
"its greatest champions.\n"
msgstr ""
"En jævnt udseende elverkriger som er teknisk brillant i mange former for\n"
"kampteknik, men skråsikker som følge deraf. Hun suppleres af sin tvillingebror\n"
"Dowans magiske evner.\n"

#. key: edmund
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:edmund"
msgid ""
"A jealous sibling of Sigmund (indeed, the youngest of nine brothers). He has\n"
"none of Sigmund's skills in magic, but makes up for it with his skills in\n"
"fighting and a canny head for money. He is eager to prove his superiority by\n"
"killing hapless adventurers with his expensive flail and quick wit.\n"
msgstr ""
"En af Sigmunds jaloux søskende (den yngste af ni brødre). Han har ingen af sin\n"
"brors magiske evner, men dette opvejes af hans kampfærdigheder og næse for\n"
"penge. Han er ivrig efter at bevise sin overlegenhed ved at dræbe uheldige\n"
"eventyrere med sin dyre plejl og sit skarpe vid.\n"

#. key: ereshkigal
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ereshkigal"
msgid ""
"Greatest and most inexorable of the Lords of Hell, Ereshkigal was born when\n"
"first a mortal breathed her last. Noiselessly she laughs at lives cut short and\n"
"loved ones separated by untimely death, enwreathed in the silence of the grave.\n"
msgstr ""
"En frygtindgydende ærkedæmon som hersker i det dødsensfarlige, underjordiske\n"
"rige Tartarus.\n"

#. key: erolcha
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:erolcha"
msgid ""
"An especially cunning ogre-mage.\n"
msgstr ""
"En særligt snu jætte-troldkvinde.\n"

#. key: eustachio
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:eustachio"
msgid ""
"An apprentice summoner with a flowing moustache. He has funny ideas about\n"
"honour.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lærling udi hidkaldelsernes kunst. Han har et bølget overskæg og nogle\n"
"underfundige idéer om ære.\n"

#. key: frances
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frances"
msgid ""
"A stout warrior who once bested a powerful lord of Pandemonium in combat,\n"
"gaining control over the demon's realm and thanes. The battle left her with a\n"
"deep facial scar, one that she carries as a badge of honour rather than a\n"
"symbol of shame.\n"
msgstr ""
"En hårdfør kriger som engang besejrede en mægtig hersker af Pandæmonium i\n"
"tvekamp og tilegnede sig dæmonens rige og lensmænd. Som resultat af kampen\n"
"pådrog hun sig et dybt ar i ansigtet som hun bærer med stolthed, snarere end\n"
"skam.\n"

#. key: frederick
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:frederick"
msgid ""
"A svelte fighter-mage with a gold-rimmed monocle, a keen sense of tradition,\n"
"and the blood of the gods running through his veins. He's here looking for a\n"
"worthy opponent, but he's yet to find one.\n"
msgstr ""
"En elegant kriger og magiker som bærer en guldrandet monokel og søger en værdig\n"
"modstander. Det er du sandsynligvis ikke.\n"

#. key: gastronok
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gastronok"
msgid ""
"A voracious and surprisingly intelligent slug, devoted to eating everything and\n"
"everyone he comes across, with a pointed hat perched rakishly atop his head. He\n"
"acquired the hat the same way he acquired his intelligence and his knowledge of\n"
"spells: by consuming their former owner, a powerful wizard.\n"
msgstr ""
"En glubsk og overraskende kløgtig snegl som er opsat på at æde alt og alle, han\n"
"møder. På hovedet har en spids hat spændstigt på sned. Han anskaffede sig\n"
"hatten på samme måde som han fik sin intelligens og sin viden om besværgelser:\n"
"ved at fortære deres tidligere ejer, en mægtig troldmand.\n"

#. key: gloorx vloq
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:gloorx vloq"
msgid ""
"A shadowy figure clothed in profound darkness.\n"
msgstr ""
"En skyggefuld skikkelse indhyllet i det dybeste mørke.\n"

#. key: grinder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grinder"
msgid ""
"An inefficient shadow imp previously employed as a torturer in one of the lower\n"
"circles of Hell. She has a tendency to complain and make inane statements.\n"
msgstr ""
"En uduelig skyggedjævleyngel, som tidligere var torturmester i en af Helvedes\n"
"lavere cirkler. Han har tendens til at brokke sig og komme med åndssvage\n"
"kommentarer.\n"

#. key: grum
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:grum"
msgid ""
"A tough-looking gnoll, wearing the pelt of one of his former war dogs.\n"
msgstr ""
"En barskt udseende gnold, som bærer en af sine tidligere krigshundes skind.\n"

#. key: harold
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:harold"
msgid ""
"A middle-aged bounty hunter, anxious to retire after one final job. He hopes to\n"
"settle down somewhere and live a quiet life with his family, using the money\n"
"from his final bounty: you.\n"
msgstr ""
"En midaldrende dusørjæger opsat på efter at trække sig tilbage fra dusørræset\n"
"efter en sidste opgave. Han ønsker at slå sig ned et sted og leve et stille liv\n"
"med sin familie for pengene fra sit sidste mål: dig.\n"

#. key: ignacio
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ignacio"
msgid ""
"While a mortal cannot turn into a demon aside from divine intervention, this is\n"
"what happened to Ignacio after Makhleb saw his love for his job and smiled upon\n"
"him. He is now slated to continue the joy of his life for all eternity.\n"
"\n"
"Although his new form includes a number of large razor-sharp blades growing\n"
"from his demonic appendages, he kept his favourite axe and is eager to let you\n"
"test its edge.\n"
msgstr ""
"En dødelig kan kun forvandles til en dæmon gennem guddommelig indgriben. Dette\n"
"skete for Ignacio, efter Makhleb så hans kærlighed til sit arbejde og\n"
"tilsmilede ham. Han er nu dømt til at fortsætte sit livs store fornøjelse i al\n"
"evighed.\n"
"\n"
"Selvom hans nye form omfatter en række barberbladsskarpe klinger, som er\n"
"udvokset fra hans dæmoniske lemmer, har Ignacio beholdt sin yndlingsøkse – og\n"
"er ivrig after at teste dens blad på dig.\n"

#. key: ijyb
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ijyb"
msgid ""
"A small and shrewd goblin inventor, wearing blue rags coated in soot.\n"
"She claims dominion over this level of the dungeon; trespassers will find\n"
"themselves on the business end of a homemade wand.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille, forskruet goblin iklædt grimme, blå laser. Han har herredømmet over\n"
"dette niveau af de underjordiske gange; indtrængende straffes med døden.\n"

#. key: jessica
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jessica"
msgid ""
"An evil apprentice sorceress. She entered the dungeon hoping to find a quiet,\n"
"secluded place where she could study the darker arts without being disturbed.\n"
msgstr ""
"En ondsindet troldkvindelærling. Hun er kommet til de underjordiske gange i\n"
"håbet om at finde et stille, afsides sted hvor hun kan studere de mørke kunster\n"
"uden at blive forstyrret.\n"

#. key: jory
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:jory"
msgid ""
"Once a simple village peasant, Jory found himself transformed in undeath into a\n"
"powerful creature. Through the countless centuries unlived since then, he has\n"
"honed his skills in combat and magic, and amassed great wealth and many\n"
"possessions.\n"
msgstr ""
"I levende live var Jory en simpel bonde, men som udød forvandlede han sig til\n"
"et magtfuldt væsen. Gennem utallige århundreders uliv har han udviklet sine\n"
"evner inden for kamp og magi, akkumuleret stor rigdom og mange ejendele.\n"

#. key: joseph
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:joseph"
msgid ""
"Looks like a mercenary in a stupid-looking hat.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ligner en lejesvend.\n"

#. key: lom lobon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lom lobon"
msgid ""
"Stoic and inscrutable, Lom Lobon is an ancient demon infamous for their mastery\n"
"of magic. Rumoured to be the most learned being in the halls of Pandemonium,\n"
"they are at times sought out by mortal wizards who offer their souls in\n"
"exchange for the secrets of the arcane. Lacking the terrible wrath present in\n"
"most demons, Lom Lobon's single eye instead hides a cold, impartial cruelty.\n"
msgstr ""
"En ældgammel og besynderligt fredfyldt dæmon. Den har et enormt, lysende øje\n"
"midt i panden med hvilket den køligt betragter dig.\n"

#. key: louise
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:louise"
msgid ""
"A mighty sorceress, clad from head to toe in heavy armour. Once an adventurer\n"
"looking for the fabled Orb of Zot, she was cast into the Abyss and got\n"
"hopelessly lost there. Toyed with by some greater power, she was stuck on the\n"
"hostile plane for nearly a decade. When she finally emerged from the Abyss,\n"
"Louise had become powerful indeed, but had also gone fully insane. She now\n"
"wanders the halls of the dungeon, seeking other adventurers to share her fate.\n"
msgstr ""
"En mægtig troldkvinde klædt i tungt panser fra top til tå. Hun var engang en\n"
"eventyrer på jagt efter den sagnomspundne Sfære fra Zot, men styrtede ned i\n"
"Afgrunden, hvor hun for håbløst vild. Louise var fanget på dette plan i næsten\n"
"et årti, mens de højere magter legede med hende. Da hun endelig undslap\n"
"Afgrunden var hun blevet ganske mægtig, men også fuldstændig vanvittig. Hun\n"
"vandrer nu hvileløst rundt i de underjordiske gange og leder efter andre\n"
"eventyrere der kan dele hendes skæbne.\n"

#. key: margery
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:margery"
msgid ""
"A lithe spellcaster in service to the powers of Hell; it is her duty to ensure\n"
"that the inhabitants of the Dungeon never forget their place. She personally\n"
"slew the ancient dragon from whose hide her strange armour is crafted.\n"
msgstr ""
"En smidig troldkvinde, som tjener helvedes kræfter. Det er hendes pligt at\n"
"sikre sig, at de underjordiske ganges beboere aldrig glemmer deres plads. Hun\n"
"dræbte selv den ældgamle drage, hvis skind blev til hendes sære rustning.\n"

#. key: maurice
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:maurice"
msgid ""
"A sly, conniving thief. A self-proclaimed legend, he was one of the most skilled\n"
"and crafty of the thieves and rogues lured by the Orb. The magical parasitic\n"
"vines that have claimed his body still wish to continue his life's work, with a\n"
"back-up plan of both a vicious magic-drinking maw and potent wands.\n"
msgstr ""
"En snu, bedragerisk tyv.\n"

#. key: menkaure
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:menkaure"
msgid ""
"A fair and noble ruler of an ancient and mighty kingdom, mummified after an\n"
"early death. His faithful priests subsequently infused him with great and\n"
"powerful magic, seeking to grant him eternal life. Now he is forgotten and\n"
"reduced to mouldering bandages and dry, brittle bones.\n"
msgstr ""
"En retfærdig og ædel hersker over et ældgammelt og mægtigt kongerige, som blev\n"
"mumificeret efter en tidlig død. Hans trofaste præster har siden tilført ham\n"
"stor og kraftfuld magi i et forsøg på at skænke ham evigt liv. Nu er han glemt\n"
"og reduceret til smuldrende bandager og tørre, skøre knogler.\n"

#. key: mennas
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mennas"
msgid ""
"There was once a human priest named Mennas. He travelled far and wide as a\n"
"missionary of Zin, often venturing even into Orcish lands. He beseeched the orcs\n"
"to abandon their false tribes and return to the peoples of their birth; only\n"
"Zin's light could truly cleanse the weight of sin that had twisted their bodies.\n"
"\n"
"By all accounts the orcs were not happy with Mennas. Eventually, a group of them\n"
"demanded he recant his words and when Mennas remained silent, they cut out his\n"
"tongue.\n"
"\n"
"Whether or not this angel is that same Mennas is something of a mystery, as he\n"
"seems to have difficulty speaking.\n"
msgstr ""
"Der var engang en menneskelig præst ved navn Mennas. Han rejste vidt og bredt\n"
"for at prædike Zin for alle, der ville lytter. Han gik endda så vidt, at han\n"
"rejste til orkernes lande for at belære dem love og nåde. Efter alt at dømme\n"
"var orkerne ikke glade for Mennas. De forlangte, at han svor, at Beogh var den\n"
"eneste sande gud, og da Mennas forblev tavs, skar de hans tunge ud.\n"
"\n"
"Om denne engel er den samme Mennas forbliver noget af et mysterium, da han\n"
"lader til at have problemer med at tale.\n"

#. key: mnoleg
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:mnoleg"
msgid ""
"A weirdly glowing figure, dancing through the twisted air of Pandemonium.\n"
msgstr ""
"En underligt lysende skikkelse, som danser gennem Pandæmoniums forvredne luft.\n"

#. key: nellie
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nellie"
msgid ""
"A highly intelligent elephant who travelled as part of a circus. One dark\n"
"night, she slipped out of her chain and disappeared into Pandemonium, never to\n"
"be seen again.\n"
msgstr ""
"En overordentligt intelligent elefant, som engang var med i et cirkus. En sen\n"
"nattetime smuttede hun ud af sin lænke, forsvandt ind i Pandæmonium og blev\n"
"aldrig set igen.\n"

#. key: nikola
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:nikola"
msgid ""
"A brilliant scientist obsessed with electricity. In his attempts to perfect his\n"
"electric golem, he was involved in a terrible accident, and now phases in and\n"
"out of reality.\n"
msgstr ""
"En genial videnskabsmand besat af elektricitet. I forsøget på at fuldende sin\n"
"elektriske golem kom han ud for en forfærdelig ulykke, og nu faser han ind og\n"
"ud af virkeligheden.\n"

#. key: pargi
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:pargi"
msgid ""
"An unusually weak troll.\n"
msgstr ""
"En usædvanligt tynd trold.\n"
"\n"
"Du kan mærke en klump i halsen.\n"

#. key: polyphemus
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:polyphemus"
msgid ""
"A cyclops shepherd, he is very protective of his charges, whom he watches with\n"
"an undying fervor through his single massive eye. Nevertheless, he won't\n"
"hesitate to use them as projectiles in a pinch; after all, the best defence is\n"
"a good offence.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kyklophyrde. Han er særdeles beskyttende over for sin hjord, som han vogter\n"
"med udødelig iver med sit ene enorme øje.\n"

#. key: rupert
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:rupert"
msgid ""
"Rippling muscles, glistening pecs, incredible glutes - Rupert is the peak of\n"
"physical perfection. Even so, his roars seem louder than even his fantastic form\n"
"can explain. Perhaps he holds some talisman that lends supernatural force to his\n"
"bellows?\n"
msgstr ""
"En mand med utroligt dårlige manerer, hvis brøl kan gøre en rise jaloux.\n"

#. key: saint roka
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:saint roka"
msgid ""
"A mighty warlord. Some orcs even say they are the Chosen One of Beogh.\n"
msgstr ""
"En mægtig krigsherre. Der er endda visse orker, som siger, at han er Beoghs\n"
"udvalgte.\n"

#. key: sigmund
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sigmund"
msgid ""
"The elder of a pair of brothers who came for the Orb. No one knows what Sigmund\n"
"saw in the dungeon to drive him mad, but his shrewd magical tactics and wicked\n"
"scythe now leave little time for his victims to wonder. Despite his reputation\n"
"as a vicious murderer, his grandiose and dramatic ways have earned him the\n"
"admiration of many denizens of the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den ældste af et par brødre, der er kommet efter Sfæren. Ingen ved, hvad\n"
"Sigmund så i de underjordiske gange, som drev ham fra forstanden, men hans\n"
"durkdrevne magiske taktikker og nådesløse le giver nu heller ikke hans ofre\n"
"meget tid til at tænke over det. På trods af hans omdømme som en blodtørstig\n"
"morder, så har hans grandiose og dramatiske stil vundet ham mange af de\n"
"underjordiske ganges indbyggeres beundring.\n"

#. key: sonja
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sonja"
msgid ""
"A graceful kobold assassin. Admire her graceful pirouettes, thrill at her\n"
"daring leaps! But watch out for her knives!\n"
msgstr ""
"En elegant koboldsnigmorder. Du kommer til at beundre hendes yndefulde\n"
"pirouetter, du vil begejstres over hendes vovefulde spring! Men pas på hendes\n"
"knive!\n"

#. key: terence
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:terence"
msgid ""
"A veteran of a war against the armataurs' elephant-riders. He has recently\n"
"retired to make a new home in the dungeon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Terence er en voldelig morder, som dræber både for fornøjelsens og pengenes\n"
"skyld. Han er tvunget i skjul efter et mislykket job, og han har ikke råd til\n"
"at lade nogen, der har set ham, undslippe de underjordiske gange i live – der\n"
"er trods alt en pris på hans hoved.\n"

#. key: urug
#. Preserve {{ lua }} delimiters exactly.
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:urug"
msgid ""
"A coarse and lanky orc. Urug lost her eye in a fight with a harpy, and has\n"
"sworn to slay every last one of them. Unfortunately, the vision in her\n"
"remaining eye is not very good, and she has mistaken you for one.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"She smells terrible.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"
msgstr ""
"En grov og ranglet ork. Urug mistede et øje i en kamp med en harpy og svor, at\n"
"han ville dræbe hver eneste af dem. Uheldigvis er synet på hans sidste øje ikke\n"
"synderligt godt, så han har forvekslet dig med en harpy.\n"
"{{\n"
"    if you.can_smell() then\n"
"        return \"Han lufter forfærdeligt.\"\n"
"    end\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: xtahua
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:xtahua"
msgid ""
"An ancient and mighty dragon.\n"
msgstr ""
"En ældgammel og mægtig drage.\n"

#. key: acid blob
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:acid blob"
msgid ""
"A lump of sickly pustulent flesh, dripping with lethal acid.\n"
msgstr ""
"En klump sygelig, pusdryppende kød hvorfra dødelig syre siver.\n"

#. key: adder
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:adder"
msgid ""
"A common dungeon snake, a species of troglodytic reptile commonly found in\n"
"subterranean spaces.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den gennemsnitlige tunnelslange. En art hulereptil, som man ofte finder under\n"
"jorden.\n"

#. key: air elemental
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:air elemental"
msgid ""
"A spirit drawn from the elemental plane of air. It exists in this world as a\n"
"lightning-spitting spirit, stunning foes with its crackling bursts.\n"
msgstr ""
"En ånd fra vindens elementarplan. I denne verden eksisterer den som en susende\n"
"hvirvelvind, der opløses og gendannes.\n"

#. key: alligator
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alligator"
msgid ""
"An aggressive crocodilian with great crunching jaws full of sharp teeth.\n"
msgstr ""
"En listig krokodille der skjuler sig i vandet og venter tålmodigt på at byttet\n"
"kommer for tæt på hvorefter den med pludselig fart og vildskab griber ofret og\n"
"knuser det mellem sine mægtige kæber.\n"

#. key: alligator snapping turtle
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:alligator snapping turtle"
msgid ""
"A particularly large and nasty snapping turtle. Like its smaller relative, it\n"
"can reach out and bite from afar.\n"
msgstr ""
"En særligt stor og fæl snapskildpadde. Den kan ligesom sine mindre slægtninge\n"
"strække sig og bide på lang afstand, og når den føler sig truet, trækker den\n"
"sig ind i sit skjold.\n"

#. key: anaconda
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:anaconda"
msgid ""
"A very large snake that moves with startling swiftness. It kills not by poison\n"
"but by constricting its prey.\n"
msgstr ""
"En meget stor slange som bevæger sig uhyggeligt hurtigt både på land og til\n"
"vands. Den dræber ikke med gift, men ved at kværke sit bytte.\n"

#. key: ancient champion
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancient champion"
msgid ""
"An unfathomably ancient skeleton. It has hundreds of golden sigils etched onto\n"
"its bones, and pulses with terrible, unholy power.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et ufatteligt gammelt skelet. Der er hundredevis af gyldne symboler skåret ind\n"
"i knoglerne og det pulserer med rædselsfuld, uhellig kraft.\n"

#. key: ancient lich
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ancient lich"
msgid ""
"A lich who, having existed for countless centuries, has grown almost\n"
"unimaginably powerful through the study of dark magic.\n"
msgstr ""
"En dødning som efter at have eksisteret i utallige århundreder har opnået en\n"
"næsten ufattelig kraft gennem sine studier af sort magi.\n"

#. key: angel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:angel"
msgid ""
"A divine warrior of the Shining One. It is a towering winged figure of\n"
"unnatural beauty surrounded by an aura of brilliant white light.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den Strålendes hellige krigere er tårnhøje, bevingede skikkelser der besidder\n"
"en unaturlig skønhed og er omgivet af en aura af blændende hvidt lys. De virker\n"
"vægtløse og smidige når de flyver på trods af deres tunge rustninger.\n"

#. key: apis
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:apis"
msgid ""
"A placid, sacred bull of Elyvilon. Its status as an exalted envoy of the Healer\n"
"lets its very presence double the health of its allies.\n"
msgstr ""
"Elyvilons fredelige, hellige tyr. Tag jer i agt, misdædere, for den vil vende\n"
"sig mod jer!\n"

#. key: azure jelly
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:azure jelly"
msgid ""
"An extremely cold blob of bright blue cytoplasm, forming bits of frost in the\n"
"air around it.\n"
msgstr ""
"En voldsomt kold klat af funklende blå cytoplasma der danner frostpartikler i\n"
"luften omkring sig.\n"

#. key: ball lightning
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ball lightning"
msgid ""
"A swift sphere of coruscating electrical energy. It will explode at the\n"
"slightest disturbance.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kæmpe, hurtig sfære af gnistrende, elektrisk energi. Den mindste\n"
"forstyrrelse vil få den til at eksplodere.\n"

#. key: ball python
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ball python"
msgid ""
"A small snake that can augment its bite by constricting small creatures.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille slange som supplerer sit bid med at kvæle små væsener.\n"

#. key: balrug
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:balrug"
msgid ""
"A huge and very powerful demon, wreathed in fire and shadows.\n"
msgstr ""
"En enorm og mægtig dæmon som er indhyllet i ild og skygger.\n"

#. key: basilisk
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:basilisk"
msgid ""
"A crested lizard of middling size with a terrible petrifying gaze.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et toppet krybdyr i mellemstørrelsen med et frygteligt forstenende blik.\n"

#. key: bat
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bat"
msgid ""
"A large grey bat that, despite being herbivorous, is quite aggressive. It is\n"
"myopic and uses echolocation to navigate.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stor, grå flagermus der er meget agressiv selvom den er planteæder. Den er\n"
"nærsynet og bruger ekkolokalisering til at navigere.\n"

#. key: black bear
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black bear"
msgid ""
"A small black bear. Like all ursines, it will become enraged if badly hurt.\n"
msgstr ""
"En lille, sort bjørn. Som alle bjørne bliver den rasende eller forskrækket hvis\n"
"den kommer slemt til skade.\n"

#. key: black mamba
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:black mamba"
msgid ""
"An astonishingly fast tropical snake whose bite bears a deadly venom.\n"
msgstr ""
"En stor og forskrækkeligt hurtig slange hvis bid overfører en dødbringende\n"
"gift.\n"

#. key: blink frog
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blink frog"
msgid ""
"A species of frog that possesses the ability to blink at will. It can blink\n"
"itself close to its intended prey, or blink away to escape harm. It is commonly\n"
"found in packs.\n"
msgstr ""
"En art kæmpefræ som kan blinke når som helst. Den kan blinke sig tættere på sit\n"
"bytte eller blinke i sikkerhed i en snæver vending. Den optræder som regel i\n"
"flok.\n"

#. key: blizzard demon
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:blizzard demon"
msgid ""
"A greater demon formed from wistful snow and bitter lightning.\n"
msgstr ""
"En større dæmon som er indhyllet i sne og lyn.\n"

#. key: brimstone fiend
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brimstone fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge and powerful demon wreathed in damnation, with great scaly wings. It is\n"
"one of the most fearsome denizens of any of the Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kæmpestor og mægtig dæmon omgivet af helvedesild med store, skællede vinger.\n"
"En af de mest frygtsomme indbyggere i alle Helvedes cirkler.\n"

#. key: executioner
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:executioner"
msgid ""
"A horribly powerful and swift demon, its shape obscured by a cloud of swirling\n"
"scythe-like blades.\n"
msgstr ""
"En skrækkeligt mægtig og lynsnar dæmon hvis form er sløret af en sky af\n"
"hvirvlende le-lignende klinger.\n"

#. key: hell sentinel
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:hell sentinel"
msgid ""
"A towering monolith constructed and possessed by demonic forces. A thousand\n"
"eyes leer through slits in its jagged, spiked armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"En tårnhøj monolit konstrueret og besat af dæmoniske kræfter. Tusind øjne\n"
"skuler grumt ud af sprækker i dens forrevne, tornede rustning.\n"

#. key: ice fiend
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:ice fiend"
msgid ""
"A huge frigid demon covered in frost and wreathed in freezing air. It is one of\n"
"the most terrible denizens of the many Hells.\n"
msgstr ""
"En kæmpemæssig frostdæmon dækket af rim og omsluttet af bidende kolde vinde. En\n"
"af de mest forfærdelige beboere i Helvedes mange cirkler.\n"

#. key: killer klown
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:killer klown"
msgid ""
"A comical figure full of life and laughter. It looks very happy to see you...\n"
"but is there a slightly malicious cast to its features? Is that red face paint\n"
"or something altogether less pleasant?\n"
msgstr ""
"En komisk figur fuld af liv og latter. Den synes at være meget glad for at se\n"
"dig ... men kan en vis skadefryd spores i dens ansigtstræk? Er det der rød\n"
"ansigtsmaling eller noget langt mindre behageligt?\n"

#. key: orb guardian
#: dat/descript/monsters.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:orb guardian"
msgid ""
"A huge, glowing, four-limbed purple creature with heightened senses, created by\n"
"the Orb itself. It guards the Orb with enormous punctiliousness and violence,\n"
"and its death will alert any Boundless Tesseracts on the level to begin creating\n"
"reinforcements.\n"
"\n"
"Unless the Orb has already been disturbed, it will refuse to abandon its duty\n"
"by leaving the floor.\n"
msgstr ""
"Et enormt, glødende, firelemmet, lilla væsen med unaturligt skarpe sanser, som\n"
"Sfæren har skabt til at vogte over den. Den bevogter Sfæren med voldsom\n"
"pertentlighed og brutalitet.\n"

#. key: dungeon
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dungeon"
msgid ""
"It is still a mystery how this bizarre place was created. Some claim that it is\n"
"the playground of bored gods, whereas others maintain that it was shaped by all\n"
"kinds of species who fled the overworld and shunned the light. No matter what\n"
"its origin, this deep cavern is filled with riches unheard of as well as with\n"
"ample dangers to any intruder. Few have escaped alive, and even fewer have kept\n"
"some sliver of sanity sufficient to tell the tale.\n"
msgstr ""
"Det er stadig et mysterium, hvordan dette bizarre sted blev skabt. Der er\n"
"nogen, der hævder, at det er en legeplads for lunefulde guder, mens andre\n"
"fastholder, at det blev formet af alle mulige arter, der er flygtet fra\n"
"overfladen og skyer lyset. Uanset oprindelsen, så er denne dybe hule fyldt med\n"
"uhørte rigdomme og alle hånde farer for enhver indtrænger. Få er sluppet ud med\n"
"livet i behold, og endnu færre havde så meget forstand tilbage, at de kunne\n"
"fortælle om det.\n"
"\n"
"De underjordiske gange er 15 niveauer dybe, men for at være helt ærlig, så er\n"
"det blot begyndelsen.\n"

#. key: elven halls
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:elven halls"
msgid ""
"The Elven Halls are home to the deep elves, a race that turned their backs on\n"
"the sun long ago. Their halls are filled with riches, but a deadly welcome\n"
"awaits any would-be robbers. In their long seclusion, the deep elves have\n"
"perfected dark sorceries of a power the orcs can only dream of!\n"
msgstr ""
"De fleste elverfolk ville aldrig flytte ind i et mørkt, underjordisk kompleks\n"
"som dette, men det gjorde dybelverne. Deres haller er fyldt med rigdomme, men\n"
"forbipasserende bør komme denne arts legendariske kundskab udi magi i hu.\n"
"\n"
"Elverfolkets haller er tre niveauer dybt.\n"

#. key: lair
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:lair"
msgid ""
"Most adventurers find the Lair of Beasts to be an exciting change of climate.\n"
"And indeed, there is something to be said about getting gored, mauled and eaten\n"
"rather than sliced, burnt or stabbed.\n"
"\n"
"The Lair contains the entrances to one of the Swamp or the Shoals, one of the\n"
"Snake Pit or the Spider Nest, and to the Pits of Slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"De fleste eventyrere synes, at Bæsternes Hule er en spændende luftforandring,\n"
"og man må indrømme, at der er meget godt at sige om at bliver stanget, flænset\n"
"og spist frem for at blive snittet, brændt eller dolket.\n"
"\n"
"Hulen er otte niveauer dyb og indeholder trapper til tre andre forgreninger.\n"

#. key: shoals
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shoals"
msgid ""
"The exotic underground beaches of the Shoals make up a few small islands in a\n"
"seemingly endless sea. The merfolk have made it their home, alongside many\n"
"dreaded sea creatures.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Shoals and Swamp branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sandbankernes eksotiske, underjordiske strande udgør en håndfuld små øer i et\n"
"tilsyneladende endeløst hav. Nøkkerne har hjemme her sammen med mange\n"
"skrækindjagende havvæsener.\n"
"\n"
"Sandbankerne er fem niveauer dybe og gemmer på den andeskællede rune. Ethvert\n"
"underjordisk kompleks af gange indeholder sandbankerne eller sumpen. Hvis\n"
"sandbankerne er der, er indgangen mellem niveau 3 og 6 af bæsternes hule.\n"

#. key: snake pit
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:snake pit"
msgid ""
"The corridors of the Snake Pit are home to all varieties of serpent, and are\n"
"inhabited by a society of powerful nagas and salamanders.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Snake Pit and Spider Nest branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ormegårdens gange huser alle mulige typer slanger og bebos af et samfund af\n"
"magtfulde nagaer og salamandere.\n"
"\n"
"Ormegården er fem niveauer dyb og gemmer på den slangebugtede rune. Ethvert\n"
"underjordisk kompleks af gange indeholder enten ormegården eller\n"
"edderkoppereden. Hvis ormegården er der er indgangen mellem niveau 3 og 6 af\n"
"bæsternes hule.\n"

#. key: spider nest
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spider nest"
msgid ""
"The crumbling, web-choked caverns of the Spider Nest are packed with poisonous\n"
"arthropods and assorted creepy-crawlies.\n"
"\n"
"A dungeon features only one of the Spider Nest and Snake Pit branches.\n"
msgstr ""
"De smuldrende, spindelvævsindhyllede grotter i edderkoppereden er fyldt med\n"
"giftige leddyr og assorterede kriblekrabler.\n"
"\n"
"Edderkoppereden er fem niveauer dyb og gemmer på den florlette rune. Ethvert\n"
"underjordisk kompleks af gange indeholder enten edderkoppereden eller\n"
"ormegården. Hvis edderkoppereden er der er indgangen mellem niveau 3 og 6 af\n"
"bæsternes hule.\n"

#. key: sewer
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sewer"
msgid ""
"Every inhabited place needs to dispose of its waste products. The Dungeon too\n"
"has its stinking sewers and drains, full of filthy water and ignored by most\n"
"but used as hideaways by the disgusting and the desperate. Old tales speak of\n"
"dangerous creatures stalking through the foul-smelling green water, preying on\n"
"each other without mercy. The tales also allude to valuable items accidentally\n"
"washed into the drainage tunnels, forgotten and left to grow mouldy in the damp\n"
"caverns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ethvert beboet sted har brug for at komme af med sit affald. Selv de\n"
"underjordiske gange har deres stinkende kloakker og afløb, som flyder med slam\n"
"og ignoreres af de fleste, men bruges som skjulested for de frastødende og de\n"
"desperate. De gamle sagn taler om farlige væsener, der jager i det\n"
"ildelugtende, grønne vand og dræber uden nåde. Fortællingerne antyder også, at\n"
"værdifulde genstande til tider skylles ned i de klamme grotter, hvor de glemte\n"
"ligger og mugner.\n"

#. key: volcano
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:volcano"
msgid ""
"Built from enormous blocks of obsidian, the volcano's sweltering chambers may\n"
"once have served as a temple to some strange deity, or perhaps the dwelling of\n"
"a mighty fire giant. The air shimmers with oppressive heat, and the dull roar\n"
"of the volcano's heart never ceases.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dette ulideligt varme kammer er bygget af enorme obsidiansten, og har måske\n"
"engang tjent som tempel til en fremmed guddom eller huset en mægtig ildkæmpe.\n"
"Luften flimrer af den trykkende hede, og det dumpe brøl af vulkanens hjerte\n"
"tier aldrig.\n"

#. key: depths
#: dat/descript/branches.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:depths"
msgid ""
"The Depths are the deepest part of the dungeon proper, subject to the\n"
"corrupting influence of the Realm of Zot without being considered a part of it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dybet er den dybeste del af de centrale underjordiske gange og er underkastet\n"
"Zots Riges forkvaklende indflydelse uden at være en del af det.\n"
"\n"
"Dybet er fem niveauer dybt og indgangen findes på de underjordiske ganges\n"
"dybeste niveau.\n"

#. key: armour
#: dat/descript/skills.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:armour"
msgid ""
"Armour skill multiplies the AC gained from wearing armour of all kinds, both\n"
"from body armour and cloaks, gloves, etc. It also slightly lessens penalties\n"
"to spellcasting and ranged weapon speed from heavy armour.\n"
msgstr ""
"Træning i rustning øger den RK, du får for at bære tung rustning og mindsker\n"
"besværet med den i forbindelse med nærkamp og besværgelser.\n"

#. key: no ability ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:no ability ability"
msgid ""
"If you get this description, it is a bug.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hvis du får denne beskrivelse er det en fejl.\n"

#. key: spit poison ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:spit poison ability"
msgid ""
"Spits poison at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"Spytter gift efter det valgte uhyre.\n"

#. key: breathe fire ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:breathe fire ability"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of fire at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"{{\n"
"    local desc = \"Ånder ild på det valgte uhyre\"\n"
"\n"
"    if you.race() == \"Red Draconian\" then\n"
"        desc = desc .. \", og efterlader en sky af flammer\"\n"
"    end\n"
"\n"
"    desc = desc .. \".\"\n"
"\n"
"    return desc\n"
"}}\n"

#. key: breathe poison gas ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:breathe poison gas ability"
msgid ""
"Breathes a blast of poison gas at a targeted creature.\n"
msgstr ""
"Udspyer en bølge af giftgas mod et uhyre.\n"

#. key: dig ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:dig ability"
msgid ""
"Allows making tunnels through soft rock and rusted grates. Activating the\n"
"ability has no cost and simply prepares you to start digging; once active,\n"
"moving into a wall will start tunnelling. Doing so makes some noise and drains\n"
"the user's maximum health.\n"
"\n"
"Once active, activating the ability again or making any non-digging movement\n"
"action will cancel the Dig status.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lader dig grave tunneller gennem bløde klipper og rustne porte. Du bekendtgør\n"
"kun din intention om at grave ved at bruge evnen, for rent faktisk at gøre det\n"
"må du bevæge dig ind i en mur. Det er naturligvis langsommere end at gå, larmer\n"
"en del og gør dig sulten.\n"

#. key: shaft self ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:shaft self ability"
msgid ""
"Sends you to a random position one to three floors down, as if you jumped into\n"
"a shaft trap. It takes some time to dig the shaft.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sender dig til en tilfældig placering en til tre niveauer nede, ligesom hvis du\n"
"var hoppet gennem en skaktfælde. Det tager tid at grave skakten.\n"

#. key: evoke berserk rage ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke berserk rage ability"
msgid ""
"<Berserk ability>\n"
msgstr ""
"Gå bersærk. Mens du er bersærk er dine livspoint og den skade du forvolder i\n"
"nærkamp voldsomt øget. Bersærkergangen ophører hurtigt, hvis du ikke dræber\n"
"noget, men kan forlænges med flere drab. Mens du er bersærk er der en række\n"
"handlinger, du ikke kan foretage dig, såsom at trække et våben, drikke noget,\n"
"vække vånde eller genstande eller kaste besværgelser. Et sådant raseri følges\n"
"som regel af en dyb udmattelse, en tid hvor du er langsom, ikke kan gå bersærk\n"
"og sommetider endda besvimer.\n"

#. key: evoke invisibility ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:evoke invisibility ability"
msgid ""
"Turns the user invisible for a short period of time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gør dig usynlig i en begrænset periode. Det øger din magiske besmittelse at\n"
"være usynlig og kan i sidste ende forårsage gløden.\n"

#. key: end transformation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:end transformation ability"
msgid ""
"Reverts you to your normal form.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vend tilbage til din normale form med en kort forsinkelse.\n"

#. key: recite ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recite ability"
msgid ""
"Preaches to nearby monsters about Zin's laws for a short duration. After\n"
"finishing a recitation, it cannot be repeated for a short time.\n"
"\n"
"The recitation will have different effects depending on the target: the chaotic\n"
"and unclean will be affected by powerful and damaging effects, undead and\n"
"demons will be affected by weaker rebukes, and any other intelligent creatures\n"
"will have confusion sown amongst them, with heretics and priests of gods other\n"
"than Zin being punished much more strongly. The effectiveness of the recitation\n"
"is increased by Invocations skill and piety.\n"
msgstr ""
"Prædiker Zins bud for uhyrer, hvilket kan føre til forskellige resultater.\n"
"Recitationen fortsætter et kort stykke tid, men afbrydes af handlinger som at\n"
"kaste besværgelser, læse skriftruller eller drikke eliksirer. Der er fire\n"
"bøger, du kan prædike fra:\n"
" • Afskyens Bog: Denne bog behandler det mest afskyvækkende, Zin kender til:\n"
"kaos i alle dets former. Disse recitationer påkalder Zins mest voldsomme vrede.\n"
" • Afsoningens Bog: De urene er næsten lige så hadet af Lovgiveren.\n"
"Recitationer fra denne bog vil forvolde sådanne væsener skade.\n"
" • Apostatens Bog: Recitation fra denne bog sår forvirring blandt intelligente\n"
"væsener. Men de som vover at tilbede andre guder end Zin, kan permanent blive\n"
"berøvet muligheden for at sprede deres modbydelige tro.\n"
" • Anatemaets Bog: Dæmoner og de udøde er hadet af Zin. Denne bog giver dig\n"
"midlerne til at irettesætte dem.\n"

#. key: vitalisation ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:vitalisation ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily provides protection from poison, confusion, petrification, and\n"
"sickness, as well as the effects of clouds of foul pestilence. Your strength,\n"
"intelligence and dexterity are also temporarily increased by a degree dependent\n"
"on Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Vitaliserer dig, så du får guddommelig udholdenhed og næring fra Zin.\n"
"Guddommelig udholdenhed beskytter dig mod sygdom, forgiftning, forstening,\n"
"forvirring og forrådnelse og øger og vedligeholder midlertidigt din styrke,\n"
"intelligens og behændighed.\n"

#. key: imprison ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:imprison ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily imprisons a monster in walls of silver. The duration of the prison\n"
"is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fængsler midlertidigt et uhyre bag vægge af sølv. Fængslets varighed øges af\n"
"din færdighed med påkaldelser.\n"

#. key: sanctuary ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:sanctuary ability"
msgid ""
"Transforms the area around the user into a domain of unbreakable law for a short\n"
"duration. So long as anyone stands within this sanctuary, no harm may be done to\n"
"them by others, and they may do no harm to others in turn.\n"
"\n"
"Beings with hostile intent are unable to enter a sanctuary and those already\n"
"nearby when it is created will be forced to flee.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du kan søge tilflugt i et guddommeligt refugie i en kort periode. Mens du er\n"
"inde i refugiet angriber uhyrer dig ikke, men beskyttelsen forsvinder, hvis du\n"
"bryder den guddommelige fred.\n"

#. key: cure all mutations ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cure all mutations ability"
msgid ""
"Cures all your mutations — but only once.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kurerer alle dine mutationer – men kun en gang.\n"

#. key: divine shield ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine shield ability"
msgid ""
"Manifests a blindingly bright shield in front of the user. Held aloft by the\n"
"Shining One's power, it will unerringly block the next several attacks which\n"
"could be blocked by a mundane shield. Ranged attacks will be reflected and melee\n"
"attackers have a chance of being briefly blinded by the resulting flash of\n"
"light.\n"
"\n"
"This shield will block only a limited number of attacks before vanishing, with\n"
"Invocations skill increasing how many.\n"
msgstr ""
"Den Strålende skænker dig et guddommeligt skjold. Fordi det bæres af gudens\n"
"kraft, kommer det ikke i vejen for dit udstyr. Men det kontrolleres af din\n"
"viljekraft, og din færdighed med skjold forbedrer det.\n"

#. key: cleansing flame ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cleansing flame ability"
msgid ""
"Invokes a huge blast of divine fury centered on the user, severely damaging\n"
"undead and demons and dealing damage to all other hostile creatures. The power\n"
"of the blast is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Påkalder en enorm eksplosion af guddommelig vrede med dig som midtpunkt, der\n"
"beskadiger udøde og dæmoner voldsomt. Alle andre fjender tager også skade, men\n"
"lidt mindre, og du og dine allierede påvirkes aldrig.\n"

#. key: summon divine warrior ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:summon divine warrior ability"
msgid ""
"Summons a powerful warrior against evil, either an angel or a daeva. The\n"
"duration of their assistance is increased by Invocations skill, and glory in\n"
"battle may lead the Shining One to bless them with an even longer stay.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hidkalder en engel eller en daeva, som er mægtige krigere mod ondskaben. De kan\n"
"blive velsignet af Den Strålende, så de kan blive længere i denne verden.\n"

#. key: recall undead harvest ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:recall undead harvest ability"
msgid ""
"Recalls your undead followers from anywhere in the dungeon to your immediate\n"
"surroundings.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kalder dine udøde følgesvende tilbage fra hvor som helst i de underjordiske\n"
"gange til din umiddelbare nærhed.\n"

#. key: bind soul ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bind soul ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to bind the soul of a living, holy, or demonic being into your eternal\n"
"service. If the targeted monster is slain before it leaves your sight, it will\n"
"return as a bound soul, retaining the equipment, spells and abilities it had in\n"
"life.\n"
"\n"
"Only beings who are relatively uninjured may be targeted, and the focus required\n"
"to keep their soul from escaping will consume 1/3 of the user's current health -\n"
"returning it only upon slaying them. The attempt will fail entirely if the\n"
"targeted monster leaves your sight before the process is complete.\n"
"\n"
"The bound soul's health is influenced by the user's Invocations skill. It will\n"
"follow its captor through stairs, and can be recalled from other levels.\n"
"\n"
"Only one soul can be bound at a time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Mærker et levende, intelligent uhyres sjæl som værende moden til at blive\n"
"plukket. Når det mærkede uhyre dør, vil dets sjæl være din.\n"
"\n"
"Den trælbundne sjæl beholder uhyrets færdigheder, udstyr og evner og noget af\n"
"dets naturlige heling. Det er dog kun et relativt uskadt uhyre, som kan få sin\n"
"sjæl markeret, og kun en sjæl kan trælbindes af gangen. Mærkningen er endvidere\n"
"afhængig af dine færdigheder med påkaldelser.\n"
"\n"
"Bemærk, at trælbundne sjæle kan følge dig væk fra det niveau, de blev skabt på.\n"

#. key: heroism ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:heroism ability"
msgid ""
"Temporarily increases all of your combat skills, both offensive and defensive.\n"
"The duration is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Øger midlertidigt alle dine kampfærdigheder, inklusive evnen til at snige dig\n"
"omkring.\n"

#. key: finesse ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:finesse ability"
msgid ""
"Greatly increases your combat speed. The duration is increased by Invocations\n"
"skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Øger din kamphastighed markant, uden tab af præcision. Denne unaturlige\n"
"virkning forårsager en anelse magisk besmittelse, som det kan være usundt at\n"
"være udsat for gennem længere tid.\n"

#. key: forget spell ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:forget spell ability"
msgid ""
"Removes a known spell from memory, so as to free memory to learn others.\n"
msgstr ""
"Glemmer enhver af de besværgelser, du i øjeblikket kan huske, så du kan få\n"
"hukommelse til at lære andre.\n"

#. key: berserk ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:berserk ability"
msgid ""
"Sends the user into a berserk rage. Going berserk temporarily increases health,\n"
"speed, and damage dealt in melee. It will time out quickly outside of combat,\n"
"but may be extended by multiple kills. While berserk, almost all actions other\n"
"than movement and melee combat are prevented. When the rage expires, the user\n"
"will be slowed and unable to berserk again for a short time.\n"
msgstr ""
"Du går bersærk. Mens du er bersærk er dine livspoint og den skade du forvolder\n"
"i nærkamp voldsomt øget, men i en begrænset periode. Bersærkergangen ophører\n"
"hurtigt, hvis du ikke dræber noget, men kan forlænges med flere drab. Mens du\n"
"er bersærk er der en række handlinger, du ikke kan foretage dig, såsom at\n"
"trække et våben, drikke noget, vække vånde eller genstande eller kaste\n"
"besværgelser. Et sådant raseri følges som regel af en dyb udmattelse, en tid\n"
"hvor du er langsom og ikke kan gå bersærk igen. I modsætning til andre kilder\n"
"til raseri, kan din fromhed hos Trog sommetider forhindre dig i at besvime.\n"

#. key: trog's hand ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:trog's hand ability"
msgid ""
"Invokes a powerful regeneration ability which stacks with all other sources and\n"
"is effective even on those who would not otherwise be able to regenerate. It\n"
"also fortifies the user's willpower, protecting against many magical effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Påkalder dig en kraftig regenerationsevne som samarbejder med alle andre kilder\n"
"til regeneration og oven i købet lader ikke-helenede arter regenerere. Dette\n"
"øger også din beskyttelse mod fjendtlige fortryllelser.\n"

#. key: brothers in arms ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:brothers in arms ability"
msgid ""
"Summons huge angry allies to wreak havoc.\n"
msgstr ""
"Hidkalder enorme, arrige allierede til at lave ravage.\n"

#. key: purification ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:purification ability"
msgid ""
"Purges your body of poison, confusion, slowness, petrification, weakness, and\n"
"sickness. Any drained maximum health will also be fully restored.\n"
msgstr ""
"Renser din krop for alle ubehagelige virkninger som sygdom, forgiftning,\n"
"langsomhed, forstening, forvirring og forrådnelse og genopretter fuldstændigt\n"
"din styrke, behændighed og intelligens.\n"

#. key: divine vigour ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:divine vigour ability"
msgid ""
"Greatly increases your maximum health and magic points, depending on\n"
"Invocations skill. Your current health and magic points will also be increased\n"
"proportionally.\n"
msgstr ""
"Dine maksimale livs- og magipoint bliver voldsomt forøget (den præcise\n"
"forøgelse afhænger af din færdighed med påkaldelser). Dine nuværende livs- og\n"
"magipoint øges proportionelt.\n"

#. key: depart the abyss ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:depart the abyss ability"
msgid ""
"Transports you out of the Abyss, returning you to the location from which you\n"
"entered it.\n"
msgstr ""
"Forlader Afgrunden til fordel for der, hvor du kom fra.\n"

#. key: banish ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:banish ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to banish a creature into the Abyss. If the attempt succeeds, you gain\n"
"some piety and the creature's full experience value. Even creatures that resist\n"
"are left malmutated and weakened by the brush with the Abyss. Invocations skill\n"
"makes Banishment harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"Forsøger at forvise et uhyre til Afgrunden.\n"

#. key: corrupt ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:corrupt ability"
msgid ""
"Corrupts the current level by unleashing Abyssal energies on it. This will\n"
"cause the area nearby to change appearance, and will gate in creatures from the\n"
"Abyss bent on causing destruction. This will not work on levels already\n"
"corrupted or in the Abyss itself. The size of the effect is increased by\n"
"Invocations skill.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fordærver det nuværende niveau ved at udsætte det for Afgrundens energier.\n"
"Dette vil vende og ned på niveauets udseende og hidkalde dæmoner fra Afgrunden,\n"
"som tørster efter død og ødelæggelse. Denne evne påvirke ikke niveauer, som\n"
"allerede er fordærvet eller som befinder sig i Afgrunden.\n"

#. key: enter the abyss ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:enter the abyss ability"
msgid ""
"Transports you to Lugonu's realm instantly. The effort of even using the\n"
"ability will leave your health depleted.\n"
msgstr ""
"Overfører dig øjeblikkeligt til Lugonus rige. Bare det at bruge den evne vil\n"
"tappe dit helbred og din energi.\n"

#. key: triple draw ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:triple draw ability"
msgid ""
"Draws three cards from any deck, and allows you to choose one to play,\n"
"discarding the other two.\n"
msgstr ""
"Træk tre kort fra en vilkårlig stak i din oppakning, se på dem og vælg, hvilket\n"
"du vil spille, og hvilke to, du vil kassere.\n"

#. key: deal four ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:deal four ability"
msgid ""
"Plays four cards from a deck in the time it normally takes to draw a\n"
"single card.\n"
msgstr ""
"Giver fire kort fra enhver umærket stak på den tid, det normalt tager at trække\n"
"et enkelt kort. Resten af stakken går tabt. Hvis stakken ikke indeholder\n"
"tilstrækkeligt med kort, giver Nemelex dig et ekstra. men det er ikke sikkert,\n"
"du bliver glad for det.\n"

#. key: stack five ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:stack five ability"
msgid ""
"Draws five cards from your choice of decks, and allows you to sort them into\n"
"any order. Subsequently, you can draw these cards in the order you chose.\n"
"Re-using this ability will discard the current stack.\n"
msgstr ""
"Trækker fem kort fra en umærket stak i din oppakning og kasserer resten af\n"
"stakken. Se på kortene og sortér dem som du har lyst til. Derefter kan du\n"
"trække kortene i den valgte rækkefølge.\n"

#. key: smiting ability
#. Preserve [[key]] references exactly.
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:smiting ability"
msgid ""
"[[Smiting spell]] The strength of the smiting is increased by Invocations skill.\n"
"\n"
"Beogh will not allow you to use this directly against another apostle during a\n"
"divine trial.\n"
msgstr ""
"Får din guds vrede til at ramme en fjende du kan se. Det kræver ikke en direkte\n"
"linje, der er nok at kunne se fjenden.\n"

#. key: bend time ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:bend time ability"
msgid ""
"Attempts to slow down everyone adjacent to you. High Invocations skill makes it\n"
"harder to resist.\n"
msgstr ""
"Forsøger at sagtne alle ved siden af dig. En høj færdighed med påkaldelser gør\n"
"den sværere at modstå.\n"

#. key: temporal distortion ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:temporal distortion ability"
msgid ""
"Warps the flow of time, causing monsters to skip forwards in time relative to\n"
"you.\n"
msgstr ""
"Forvrænger tidens strøm omkring dig, så uhyrer hopper fremad i tid i forhold\n"
"til dig.\n"

#. key: slouch ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slouch ability"
msgid ""
"Causes damage to everyone in sight who is moving faster than you, dealing more\n"
"damage with greater differences in speed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Skader alle i syne som bevæger sig hurtigere end dig. De der er magisk\n"
"forhastede, kommer særligt slemt til skade.\n"

#. key: step from time ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:step from time ability"
msgid ""
"Removes you completely from the flow of time. Time will pass as it usually does,\n"
"and monsters will wander away and sometimes even fall back to sleep. After some\n"
"time has passed, you will return in the same state as the very second you\n"
"departed.\n"
"\n"
"Invocations skill increases the likelihood that your absence will have been so\n"
"long that alert monsters have fallen asleep again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fjerner dig fra tidens strøm. Ting omkring sker med deres sædvanlige tempo,\n"
"uhyrer vandrer omkring, forgængelige ting forfalder, planter vokser. Efter et\n"
"stykke tid vender du tilbage i samme tilstand som i det præcise sekund du drog\n"
"af sted.\n"

#. key: slimify ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:slimify ability"
msgid ""
"Coats a wielded weapon or your fists with slime, turning the next living or\n"
"corporeal undead monster hit into a neutral slime.\n"
msgstr ""
"Betrækket våbnet i dine hænder eller dine næver med slim, som vil forvandle det\n"
"næste levende eller udøde uhyre til en neutral slim.\n"

#. key: renounce religion ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:renounce religion ability"
msgid ""
"Renounces your faith. This will make you leave your god (and usually anger\n"
"said god).\n"
msgstr ""
"Forsager din tro. Dette vil få din karakter til at forlade sin gud (hvilket som\n"
"regel vækker gudens vrede).\n"

#. key: convert to beogh ability
#: dat/descript/ability.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:convert to beogh ability"
msgid ""
"Swears fealty to Beogh, the god of cave orcs. This god demands that all\n"
"non-believers must die, but new believers must be spared and accepted into the\n"
"fold. Beware, for orcs who do not see you convert may still be hostile until\n"
"you have built your reputation!\n"
"\n"
"All other gods hate Beogh, and do not take desertion lightly.\n"
msgstr ""
"Sværg troskab til Beogh, huleorkernes gud. Denne gud kræver alle hedninges død,\n"
"men nye troende skal skånes og accepteres ind i folden. Pas på, for orker, som\n"
"ikke har set dig konvertere er måske stadig fjendtlige indtil du har opbygget\n"
"et omdømme!\n"
"\n"
"Alle andre guder hader Beogh og tager ikke let på desertering.\n"

#. key: a buggy card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a buggy card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts a Crawl player filing a bug report on Mantis.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card is a bug, if one ever encounters it as such.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fejlbehæftet (det er en fejl, hvis du nogensinde ser den her.)\n"

#. key: a very buggy card
#: dat/descript/cards.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:a very buggy card"
msgid ""
"The card depicts several Crawl players angrily filing several bug reports on\n"
"Mantis.\n"
"\n"
"Drawing this card is a bug, if one ever encounters it as such.\n"
msgstr ""
"Fejlbehæftet (det er en fejl, hvis du nogensinde ser den her.)\n"

#. key: cmd_rest
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest"
msgid ""
"Rest and heal\n"
msgstr ""
"Hvil og hel\n"

#. key: cmd_rest verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_rest verbose"
msgid ""
"Rests while your health and magic regenerate. Resting is interrupted as soon\n"
"as a hostile monster comes into view. If health and magic are both already\n"
"full, resting will wait for 100 turns.\n"
msgstr ""
"Brug op til 100 ture på at genvinde helbred og/eller magi. Dit hvil vil blive\n"
"afbrudt, så snart du får øje på et fjendtligt uhyre.\n"

#. key: cmd_explore
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore"
msgid ""
"Autoexplore the current level\n"
msgstr ""
"Autoudforsker det nuværende niveau\n"

#. key: cmd_explore verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_explore verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically explores the current level, collecting items on the way.\n"
"Exploration stops as soon as a hostile monster comes into view, or when you\n"
"encounter new items or features.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lader din karakter rejse på autopilot mod uudforskede områder af det nuværende\n"
"niveau og samle genstande, der er underlagt automatisk opsamling, undervejs.\n"
"Rejsen stopper, så snart et fjendtligtsindet uhyrer kommer til syne, og når\n"
"genstande og landmærker skal annonceres.\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel"
msgid ""
"Travel to distant levels\n"
msgstr ""
"Rejs til fjerne niveauer\n"

#. key: cmd_interlevel_travel verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_interlevel_travel verbose"
msgid ""
"Automatically travels to a chosen level or branch. Travel is interrupted by\n"
"monsters coming into view.\n"
msgstr ""
"Rejs automatisk til fjerne niveauer. Rejsen bliver afbrudt, hvis uhyrer kommer\n"
"til syne.\n"

#. key: cmd_use_ability
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_use_ability"
msgid ""
"Use divine, innate or evokable abilities\n"
msgstr ""
"Brug guddommelige eller iboende evner\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes"
msgid ""
"Search for items/features\n"
msgstr ""
"Led efter genstande/elementer\n"

#. key: cmd_search_stashes verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_search_stashes verbose"
msgid ""
"Searches for items or features seen elsewhere, and allows you to travel to\n"
"their location.\n"
msgstr ""
"Søger efter genstande eller områder, du har set andetsteds, og rejser derhen.\n"

#. key: cmd_replay_messages
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_replay_messages"
msgid ""
"Reread recent messages\n"
msgstr ""
"Læs de nyeste beskeder igen\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen"
msgid ""
"Display character overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser et overblik over karakteren\n"

#. key: cmd_resists_screen verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_resists_screen verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of your current resistances, abilities, equipment and\n"
"attributes.\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser oplysninger om kendte modstandsdygtigheder, evner, udstyrsstatistik osv.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap"
msgid ""
"Display dungeon overview\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser oversigtskortet over de underjordiske gange\n"

#. key: cmd_display_overmap verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_overmap verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays an overview of dungeon branch locations, discovered altars, shops and\n"
"level annotations.\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser placeringen af indgange til forgreninger, butikker og andre\n"
"karakteristiske træk, du er stødt på.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion"
msgid ""
"Display religious status\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser religiøs status\n"

#. key: cmd_display_religion verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_religion verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays your god's likes and dislikes, conduct, and your current religious\n"
"standing and divine abilities.\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser, hvad din gud kan lide og ikke kan lide, opførsel og din nuværende\n"
"religiøse anseelse og guddommelige evner.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_mutations
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_mutations"
msgid ""
"Display mutations\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser mutationer\n"

#. key: cmd_display_skills
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_skills"
msgid ""
"Manage skills\n"
msgstr ""
"Hold styr på dine færdigheder\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status"
msgid ""
"Display character status\n"
msgstr ""
"Vis karakterens status\n"

#. key: cmd_display_character_status verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_character_status verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays details on your current movement speed, attack speed, stealth, magic\n"
"resistance, and any currently active enchantments or status effects.\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser aktive fortryllelser og et par andre ting.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_known_objects
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_known_objects"
msgid ""
"List discovered item types\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser en liste over typer af genstande, du har mødt\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now"
msgid ""
"Save and exit\n"
msgstr ""
"Gem og afslut\n"

#. key: cmd_save_game_now verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_save_game_now verbose"
msgid ""
"Saves the game for later and exits. Once you resume the game, the save file is\n"
"deleted again.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gemmer spillet til senere og afslutter. Når du genoptager spillet, vil de gemte\n"
"data blive slettet.\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile"
msgid ""
"Modify the player tile\n"
msgstr ""
"Lav om på spillergrafikken\n"

#. key: cmd_edit_player_tile verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_edit_player_tile verbose"
msgid ""
"Allows you to modify the equipment and species tile displayed in the player\n"
"doll.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tilpasser den grafik, der bliver vist for udstyr og art på spillerdukken.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands"
msgid ""
"Game help\n"
msgstr ""
"Spilhjælp\n"

#. key: cmd_display_commands verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_commands verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a list of commands.\n"
msgstr ""
"Liste med kommandoer, indstillinger osv.\n"

#. key: cmd_character_dump verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_character_dump verbose"
msgid ""
"Dumps detailed information about your character into a file ‘playername.txt’ in\n"
"the morgue directory, to peruse at your leisure. This includes main stats,\n"
"equipment, spells, skills, notes, etc.\n"
msgstr ""
"Gemmer en masse oplysninger om din karakter i en fil ved navn 'spillernavn.txt'\n"
"i morgue-mappen, så du kan læse den, når du lyster. Dette inkluderer de\n"
"vigtigste statistikker, dit udstyr, dine besværgelser, færdigheder, noter osv.\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight"
msgid ""
"Hit the closest monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Slå det nærmeste uhyre\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight verbose"
msgid ""
"Moves towards the closest hostile monster, or attacks an adjacent monster with\n"
"your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ryk frem mod det nærmeste, fjendtlige uhyre, og angrib det med det\n"
"forhåndenværende våben.\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove"
msgid ""
"Hit an adjacent monster\n"
msgstr ""
"Slå et uhyre ved siden af dig\n"

#. key: cmd_autofight_nomove verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_autofight_nomove verbose"
msgid ""
"Attacks an adjacent monster with your current weapon.\n"
msgstr ""
"Angriber et uhyre ved siden af dig med dit våben.\n"

#. key: cmd_wait
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait"
msgid ""
"Wait a single turn\n"
msgstr ""
"Vent en enkelt tur\n"

#. key: cmd_wait verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_wait verbose"
msgid ""
"Spends a single turn waiting and resting.\n"
msgstr ""
"Bruger en enkelt tur på at vente og hvile.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory"
msgid ""
"Display the contents of your inventory\n"
msgstr ""
"Vis indholdet af din oppakning\n"

#. key: cmd_display_inventory verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_inventory verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays the contents of your inventory.\n"
msgstr ""
"Viser indoholdet af din oppakning.\n"

#. key: cmd_cast_spell
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_cast_spell"
msgid ""
"Cast a spell\n"
msgstr ""
"Kast en besværgelse\n"

#. key: cmd_cast_spell verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_cast_spell verbose"
msgid ""
"Casts a spell.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kaster en besværgelse.\n"

#. key: cmd_memorise_spell
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_memorise_spell"
msgid ""
"Memorise spell\n"
msgstr ""
"Lær besværgelse\n"

#. key: cmd_memorise_spell verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_memorise_spell verbose"
msgid ""
"Memorises a chosen spell from your spell library.\n"
msgstr ""
"Læser en besværgelse fra en bog, du holder eller står på, og husker den.\n"

#. key: cmd_drop
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop"
msgid ""
"Drop items\n"
msgstr ""
"Smid genstande\n"

#. key: cmd_drop verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_drop verbose"
msgid ""
"Drops one or more items that you are currently holding.\n"
msgstr ""
"Smid en eller flere af de genstande, du bærer på.\n"

#. key: cmd_display_map
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_map"
msgid ""
"Enter map mode\n"
msgstr ""
"Gå i korttilstand\n"

#. key: cmd_display_map verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_display_map verbose"
msgid ""
"Displays a map of the current level.\n"
msgstr ""
"Lader dig navigere rundt på det af kortet, du tidligere har udforsket.\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_target
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_target"
msgid ""
"Travel to cursor\n"
msgstr ""
"Rejs til markør\n"

#. key: cmd_map_goto_target verbose
#: dat/descript/commands.txt
msgctxt ""
"textdb:descriptions:cmd_map_goto_target verbose"
